  ('PF2','Fixed-term contract limits (2-yr cap, one renewal, FTCIS). Contracts & engagement. Since 6 December 2023, fixed-term contracts generally cannot exceed 2 years (including renewals), cannot be renewed more than once, and cannot include an "evergreen" auto-renewal clause, subject to a list of exceptions (e.g., genuine seasonal work, specific-task funding, high-income employees). Employers must give a Fixed Term Contract Information Statement (FTCIS) each time they enter a new fixed-term contract. Common questions: Can I just keep rolling her 12-month contract every year? What''s this Fixed Term Contract Information Statement I keep hearing about? Is a 3-year fixed contract even legal now? She''s on her second 1-year contract — am I in trouble?','[-0.002200,-0.029939,0.018516,0.021294,-0.018866,0.073414,-0.082842,0.031019,-0.051534,0.056423,-0.007909,0.079956,-0.079115,0.000350,-0.000088,0.056420,-0.055794,0.033971,0.058195,-0.002340,0.080138,0.004441,0.002923,0.024951,0.008397,0.005456,-0.040791,0.023666,0.034191,0.003177,0.009136,0.093204,-0.002478,0.052622,0.058176,-0.014335,-0.071749,0.062195,-0.025028,-0.023439,-0.034044,-0.049904,0.008418,-0.028183,-0.037116,-0.066044,-0.014733,0.014656,-0.040595,0.036696,0.050685,-0.010853,-0.030814,0.045928,0.005846,-0.030327,-0.041648,-0.028644,-0.079360,0.047387,-0.034829,-0.011590,-0.037851,0.024295,-0.092440,0.012326,-0.003207,0.029611,-0.000079,0.091869,-0.082044,-0.010439,-0.061653,-0.056181,0.046920,0.089690,0.020948,0.018055,0.092006,-0.003649,-0.056264,-0.019410,0.083139,0.004568,-0.019204,-0.033789,-0.017151,-0.034057,0.000615,-0.036646,0.080955,-0.047270,0.103445,-0.022552,-0.121397,-0.017899,0.004457,-0.025106,0.025546,0.000874,-0.010539,-0.012350,-0.071125,-0.002171,-0.044690,-0.059855,-0.010267,-0.018789,0.000512,0.013768,0.019749,0.012471,0.015479,-0.022420,0.003492,0.015338,-0.069913,0.014855,0.023304,-0.052224,0.010794,0.044609,-0.024381,0.001537,-0.018976,-0.061788,0.058628,0.000000,-0.019732,0.016184