  ('PF3','Employee vs contractor - new "whole of relationship" test. Classification. From 26 August 2024, a new s15AA of the Fair Work Act requires the "real substance, practical reality and true nature" of the relationship to be assessed — looking at the totality of the relationship including how the contract is actually performed in practice, not just the contract''s wording. This overturns the High Court''s 2022 contract-first approach (*Personnel Contracting*/*Jamsek*) for Fair Work Act purposes, reintroducing the pre-2022 multi-factor test. Common questions: I''ve got a contractor who''s basically been here 3 years working like an employee — am I okay? Does having an ABN and invoicing make someone a contractor? What actually decides if someone''s an employee or a contractor now? My accountant says he''s a contractor but I''m not sure that''s still right','[-0.103538,0.020653,0.026518,-0.088635,-0.031990,0.085796,-0.073791,-0.044726,-0.002720,0.066280,0.037013,0.025913,-0.026854,0.017245,-0.002168,-0.012189,0.080810,0.020435,-0.026100,-0.060403,0.014923,-0.055502,-0.029397,0.016218,0.000430,-0.035457,0.008940,0.017399,-0.037393,0.021074,0.038148,0.145148,0.004681,-0.047660,0.030670,-0.001032,0.012927,-0.014362,0.027335,-0.007228,-0.027127,-0.079732,0.038018,0.027063,0.031974,-0.010015,0.010037,-0.014693,-0.095437,0.036414,-0.016172,-0.022418,0.026666,0.059729,0.047662,-0.027399,-0.010794,-0.032624,-0.037980,0.063305,-0.039726,-0.037985,-0.024324,-0.011891,0.090910,-0.024533,-0.060401,-0.067932,-0.075372,0.049754,-0.051120,-0.024623,-0.017900,0.001165,0.086711,0.004971,-0.054535,0.028738,0.104298,-0.120997,0.000357,-0.020511,-0.038153,-0.013388,-0.005095,-0.005618,0.030732,-0.042937,0.001104,0.016143,0.064530,-0.051945,0.031806,0.016467,-0.082305,0.025159,-0.022827,0.028152,0.034814,0.028744,0.001077,0.014229,0.003467,-0.031154,-0.034781,-0.014530,0.059631,-0.064783,0.017976,-0.038392,0.041462,-0.026186,-0.021701,-0.073341,-0.002014,0.041993,-0.065008,0.078042,0.