  ('PF7','Casual conversion - Employee Choice Pathway. Classification. Replacing the old employer-initiated casual conversion regime, the Employee Choice Pathway (from 26 February 2025, or 26 August 2025 for small employers under 15 employees) lets casual employees themselves initiate a move to permanent employment once they''ve been employed 6 months (12 months for small business) and believe they no longer meet the casual definition. Common questions: One of my casuals wants to go permanent — what do I actually have to do? Can I say no if I don''t want to make her permanent? How long do I have to respond to a conversion request? Is this different for small businesses like mine?','[0.027293,0.016146,0.001753,-0.022310,0.051689,0.057161,-0.052791,-0.016389,-0.033878,-0.039269,0.073853,-0.027531,-0.077091,-0.056342,0.051552,0.032923,-0.011761,0.004997,0.028594,-0.018533,-0.049196,-0.072221,-0.110155,-0.024811,0.095115,-0.094108,0.027442,0.015831,-0.021035,0.025183,-0.059136,0.128553,-0.027039,0.058478,0.065610,-0.000482,0.017372,0.033278,0.007041,-0.009222,0.002968,-0.155450,-0.062020,-0.053685,-0.055299,-0.025771,0.009667,0.011101,-0.074597,0.048188,-0.018398,0.027178,-0.042657,0.073483,-0.034927,0.028476,-0.009362,0.012795,-0.018235,0.001995,-0.082078,-0.019805,-0.059594,0.033603,-0.033803,0.006312,-0.002542,-0.044854,0.087108,0.006928,-0.099456,-0.058698,-0.134651,0.059998,0.035028,-0.088524,-0.029980,0.061824,0.077615,0.000189,-0.017656,0.035843,-0.050275,0.071047,-0.040566,-0.029363,-0.017575,0.103810,0.047419,0.006230,-0.028812,0.033081,0.037932,-0.028996,-0.012499,-0.019796,-0.105419,0.005796,0.035729,-0.011621,-0.035967,0.018409,-0.042525,-0.037810,-0.076566,-0.065845,0.025549,0.060285,0.051509,0.010753,-0.012190,0.047444,0.053021,-0.073253,0.001023,0.088190,-0.106224,0.025573,0.038466,0.039155,-0.063045,0.100290,-0.056059,0.044019,-0.103084,0.046627,0.031895,0.000000,-0.041353,-0.015736,0.008703,0.027175,-0.071715,0.022133,0.029593,-0.006178,0.032578,-0.0025