  ('PF8','Which award (if any) applies. Award coverage. Over 120 modern awards exist, each with a coverage clause (typically clause 4) defining which industries/occupations it applies to. An employer is covered if the business falls within the award''s defined industry; an employee is covered if a matching classification exists for their role. Awards cannot be contracted out of. Common questions: Which award actually covers my business? I run a café that also does catering — which award wins? Do I even need to worry about an award if I pay above minimum wage? My employee''s title doesn''t match anything in the award — now what?','[0.025044,0.086757,0.029714,-0.053621,0.029931,0.156388,0.060174,-0.086789,-0.038917,-0.055121,-0.075432,-0.080277,0.007367,0.008692,-0.028337,-0.024191,0.035614,-0.037739,0.013311,-0.089435,0.068422,0.071419,-0.029047,-0.077112,-0.015992,-0.052977,0.040504,0.002175,-0.032691,-0.024133,-0.115818,-0.070521,0.045437,0.057581,-0.017868,-0.039572,-0.019734,-0.068560,-0.035442,0.024755,-0.007424,-0.041456,-0.000210,-0.028553,0.119845,-0.037998,0.009265,-0.039282,-0.086048,-0.014124,-0.006161,0.000678,0.053365,0.073006,-0.032506,-0.048322,-0.086953,-0.019441,-0.046434,0.096575,-0.019438,-0.034959,-0.029320,0.064813,-0.010959,-0.078813,-0.061867,-0.009877,-0.105733,-0.043165,0.050136,-0.014309,-0.020847,-0.053252,0.067222,0.026977,-0.019004,-0.010701,0.049270,0.008217,-0.004407,-0.030471,0.007277,0.004064,-0.007176,-0.033164,0.013318,-0.039276,0.020850,0.054557,-0.035451,-0.116818,0.028647,0.018684,0.020203,0.016830,0.012546,-0.003325,0.052284,-0.015451,-0.046833,-0.035839,-0.055606,0.044313,0.009604,0.018331,0.040988,-0.027076,-0.013716,-0.048572,0.008138,0.082960,0.051078,0.000003,-0.030968,0.021960,-0.026563,0.002605,0.078618,-0.010311,-0.054673,0.059531,0.024449,-0.061288,-0.087251,0.025774,-0.034447,-0.000000,0.037646,-0.031403,-0.006979,0.023655,0.082323,-0.015344,0.000302,0.021107,0.007021,0.083668,-0.027423,0.103698,0.047041,0.044247,0.035