  ('PF15','Personal/carer''s leave & the casual gap. NES/leave. Non-casual employees accrue 10 days'' paid personal/carer''s leave per year of service, accruing progressively and carrying over (unlike annual leave, unused personal leave does not usually get paid out on termination). Casuals are not entitled to paid personal leave but do get 2 days'' unpaid carer''s leave per occasion. Common questions: How many sick days does everyone get? Can I ask for a medical certificate every time? Does a casual get paid sick leave? What''s the difference between sick leave and carer''s leave — are they the same bucket?','[0.005843,-0.016059,0.030247,-0.008978,0.071957,0.080686,0.033355,0.046125,-0.064576,-0.038365,0.059062,-0.062542,-0.080093,-0.001694,0.030043,-0.080718,-0.001954,-0.061467,-0.004572,0.014147,-0.082769,-0.009057,-0.022914,-0.021921,0.006737,-0.027532,0.025539,0.035024,0.036798,0.057573,-0.026826,0.041733,0.004785,0.008930,-0.046360,-0.048382,0.014925,0.023392,-0.079834,-0.018405,-0.046451,-0.025815,0.028301,0.018739,0.009315,0.064078,-0.069493,-0.021957,-0.064309,0.092473,-0.038119,-0.000042,0.000552,0.190173,0.011758,-0.023407,-0.016426,-0.129949,-0.094427,0.017005,-0.102590,0.010046,-0.051094,0.001141,-0.031020,-0.019213,-0.009207,-0.012412,0.065841,-0.030848,-0.183265,-0.038792,-0.035941,0.049354,0.016795,0.030135,0.023492,-0.024969,-0.039493,-0.085133,-0.024527,0.114926,0.040838,0.041708,-0.031727,-0.061252,0.040652,0.018151,0.016039,0.017076,0.060467,0.097056,0.028575,-0.096454,-0.000030,0.028348,0.001327,0.079000,-0.033948,-0.033740,0.006067,-0.031500,0.031620,0.015435,0.076000,0.063876,-0.023047,-0.034197,0.014712,-0.011387,-0.035680,0.126445,-0.004832,-0.125672,0.048791,0.063579,0.001073,0.008341,0.141259,0.048337,-0.023457,0.037778,-0.108278,0.006880,-0.031420,0.035106,0.022583,0.000000,0.054861,-0.021597,0.038336,0.068120,-0.014285,-0.066931,-0.045266,0.024369,0.122169,0.024670,0.018568,-0.008634,-0.033214,-0.019898,0.056585,0.004783,-0.034920,-0.052