  ('PF16','Parental leave & the govt PPL interaction. NES/leave. The NES gives eligible employees up to 12 months'' unpaid parental leave (with a right to request a further 12 months), separate from the Commonwealth Paid Parental Leave (PPL) scheme administered by Services Australia, which is expanding to 130 days (26 weeks) for children born/adopted from 1 July 2026, now with an employer-independent 12% government superannuation contribution (PPLSC) starting to flow from July 2026. Common questions: Do I have to pay her while she''s on maternity leave? How does government paid parental leave actually work — do I administer it? Does she still get super while she''s on parental leave now? How long can someone be away and still have a job to come back to?','[-0.080092,-0.014521,-0.003040,0.037029,0.035169,0.142026,-0.007490,0.017746,0.015518,0.098181,0.040459,0.016918,-0.068915,-0.017779,0.009513,0.055771,0.059498,-0.056870,0.007211,-0.063184,0.037531,-0.084304,-0.030431,-0.008978,0.087971,0.067881,-0.001467,0.056853,0.073631,0.075241,0.020332,-0.005503,0.021640,-0.037015,-0.011648,0.044254,-0.019761,0.003944,-0.018974,-0.043646,0.040741,0.025296,-0.029939,-0.006720,0.024349,-0.031411,-0.039549,-0.012705,-0.125892,0.014432,0.022965,-0.050922,0.034741,0.077452,-0.012434,-0.038379,0.067106,-0.124033,-0.006376,-0.048719,-0.121323,0.005505,-0.096132,-0.030196,-0.023045,0.002686,0.023960,-0.024816,0.114212,-0.098912,-0.163114,0.096727,0.040240,0.030783,0.004223,0.045177,0.084257,0.049178,0.056997,-0.118454,0.035264,0.083403,0.063939,0.037717,0.024118,-0.024302,0.046664,-0.006969,0.026620,-0.004277,0.047928,0.027047,0.083162,0.000525,-0.062384,-0.089450,-0.055101,-0.071142,-0.006163,-0.041367,0.030847,0.038317,0.037683,0.064565,-0.067794,0.011724,-0.038525,-0.005711,0.023480,0.046496,-0.065193,0.023514,-0.018763,0.009260,-0.039976,0.035461,-0.006707,0.048038,0.068318,-0.100147,0.016325,0.044375,-0.125514,-0.059356,-0.022236,-0.058335,-0.027926,0.000000,-0.043023,-0.030857,0