  ('PF17','Long service leave - state-by-state. NES/leave. Long service leave (LSL) is not part of the NES — it is governed separately by each state/territory. NSW, QLD, WA and TAS give 8.6667 weeks at 10 years'' service; VIC and ACT give 6.0667 weeks at 7 years; SA and NT give 13 weeks at 10 years. Pro-rata access rules on early termination also differ significantly by state (e.g. NSW allows pro-rata after 5 years for most termination reasons; QLD''s pro-rata trigger is narrower and tied to specified termination reasons). Common questions: How much long service leave does someone get after 10 years? Is long service leave different in each state? If I make someone redundant after 6 years, do they get any long service leave payout? We''re based in NSW but have a remote worker in Queensland — whose LSL rules apply?','[-0.006588,-0.017665,0.022891,-0.046224,0.025969,0.082757,-0.088555,-0.021986,-0.014455,0.016744,0.001004,0.066418,-0.045149,0.042984,0.008504,-0.030057,0.024977,-0.142562,-0.015013,-0.007735,0.059820,-0.023680,-0.080909,0.030603,0.080913,-0.020063,0.002173,0.022814,0.046820,0.011412,0.035490,0.003554,0.008461,-0.066310,0.071062,0.020520,-0.057579,-0.021841,-0.015006,-0.019152,0.041645,0.043781,-0.009328,0.049452,-0.020679,0.025512,0.014554,-0.026961,-0.023120,0.089261,-0.007645,0.002278,0.014193,0.158706,-0.040497,-0.042085,0.016072,-0.019336,-0.121191,0.076940,-0.102515,0.067750,-0.063987,-0.026160,0.013102,0.007123,-0.034250,-0.065356,0.013514,-0.049846,-0.176232,-0.061238,0.013179,0.087027,0.039070,0.043458,0.052967,0.032984,0.011734,-0.189210,0.049122,0.051713,-0.032902,0.026377,0.037887,-0.046059,-0.017615,0.030171,0.038548,-0.030398,0.109753,0.013218,0.055859,-0.070037,0.029700,-0.060558,0.051161,0.018930,-0.043454,-0.019570,0.006798,-0.019866,-0.066095,0.007429,0.011558,0.006350,-0.054444,0.052270,-0.038825,-0.030388,0.015416,0.107026,0.014410,-0.008101,0.009708,0.114629,-0.040352,0.061329,0.092779,0.000932,0.039147,-0.026488,-0.084059,-0.030962,-