  ('PF18','Compassionate/bereavement leave (incl. miscarriage). NES/leave. All employees, including casuals, get 2 days'' compassionate leave per permissible occasion (paid for permanent staff, unpaid for casuals) on the death, life-threatening illness/injury of an immediate family/household member, a stillbirth, or a miscarriage. The Sex Discrimination and Fair Work (Respect at Work) Amendment Act 2021 extended coverage explicitly to miscarriage (loss before 20 weeks), for either partner, regardless of how the pregnancy was achieved. Common questions: Does compassionate leave cover a miscarriage? Do casuals get bereavement leave too? How many days off does someone get when a family member dies? Is this the same as ''bereavement leave'' or something different?','[-0.009245,0.026799,0.003655,0.037763,0.069277,0.061876,-0.037585,-0.018586,-0.012989,0.016630,-0.043934,0.074644,-0.085396,-0.023459,-0.003708,0.024882,0.054971,-0.028940,-0.051178,0.061132,0.006886,0.005265,-0.022068,0.071605,0.062042,-0.101701,0.017932,0.096539,0.006244,0.046952,0.032469,-0.041790,-0.029777,-0.024178,-0.042359,0.060043,-0.033946,0.024079,0.008640,-0.012456,-0.006831,0.036226,0.011566,0.080165,0.069788,-0.016778,-0.080561,-0.054308,-0.050597,-0.002474,-0.002391,-0.064071,-0.031801,0.123288,0.016783,-0.082655,0.001482,-0.016875,-0.099312,0.013923,0.010712,-0.046556,0.006575,-0.019700,-0.064379,0.048790,0.049060,-0.077534,0.069688,-0.044720,-0.046670,-0.033783,0.044420,0.102288,0.000010,0.032597,0.108945,0.015722,-0.009536,-0.082927,-0.028108,0.044641,0.032853,-0.002759,-0.020592,-0.046098,0.030037,-0.003651,0.096389,-0.015088,0.026368,0.045669,0.049619,-0.018497,-0.088503,-0.039872,-0.001217,-0.012164,-0.033635,0.039272,0.008012,-0.016853,-0.027428,0.004696,0.025240,-0.015487,-0.078206,-0.024697,-0.048784,0.018159,-0.017378,0.033337,0.051289,-0.013571,-0.001875,0.050349,-0.033093,0.017894,0.095769,-0.004716,0.019346,0.076673,-0.046295,0.015275,-0.033005,-0.050870,-0.026079,0.000000,0.058147