  ('PF28','Single Touch Payroll (STP) compliance. Payroll. STP requires employers to report payroll information (salary/wages, PAYG withholding, super) to the ATO each pay run through STP-enabled software, replacing end-of-year payment summaries with real-time reporting. Common questions: Do I have to use special software or can I keep using my spreadsheet? What actually gets reported to the ATO each pay run? What happens if I miss an STP report? Is STP the same thing as paying tax and super, or separate?','[-0.072232,0.041395,-0.045149,0.030301,-0.008723,0.092822,-0.019125,0.031421,-0.055832,-0.001577,-0.013885,0.047153,-0.052660,-0.062278,-0.051386,-0.052649,0.074061,-0.060707,0.110505,0.008066,0.078784,-0.038331,-0.102959,-0.022858,0.072930,-0.004675,-0.056342,0.030929,-0.042972,0.011877,-0.044722,0.053454,0.069075,0.046883,-0.050700,-0.028435,0.020661,-0.015103,-0.108840,-0.090867,-0.009670,-0.055649,-0.027912,-0.025773,-0.021961,-0.028652,0.025762,0.082660,-0.061067,0.036523,0.026714,-0.027717,0.082178,0.106222,-0.009674,0.007329,-0.008333,-0.044255,-0.016507,-0.034942,-0.110160,-0.008312,-0.012698,0.042505,0.128096,0.067245,-0.029621,-0.026261,-0.004006,-0.019984,-0.143281,-0.016951,0.033540,0.044439,0.025480,-0.011255,-0.083871,0.038633,0.015791,-0.103483,0.009021,0.046337,-0.011889,0.033646,0.064938,-0.016967,0.064178,0.083908,0.069219,-0.033074,0.050049,0.008272,-0.007370,-0.059840,-0.058411,-0.008981,-0.008830,-0.017497,0.070116,-0.058441,0.047171,-0.030881,0.052316,-0.006993,0.024343,-0.008820,0.002438,-0.081220,0.029277,-0.022497,0.048297,-0.012797,-0.046897,-0.129225,0.036444,0.027205,-0.070653,0.044357,0.006887,0.005772,-0.056494,0.032549,-0.064683,0.013690,0.070847,-0.002244,-0.011973,0.000000,0.005473,0.036490,0.014773,-0.072517,0.058243,-0.000001,0.020423,0.039745,0.047091,0.060431,-0.020759,0.047056,0.039802,-0.029604,0.052357,0.057351,-0.022049,0.069351,0.080782,0.036066,0.016394,-0.073857,0.001020,0.028401,0.035631,0.097819,-0.042770,-0.015846,0.