  ('PM2','Weak/absent structured onboarding. Onboarding. SMEs frequently onboard with "here''s your desk, ask Dave if you''re stuck" rather than a structured 30/60/90-day plan with documented performance and behavioural expectations. Because expectations are never written down, the business has nothing to point to later if performance or conduct becomes an issue — which directly undermines any subsequent PIP, warning, or dismissal defence. Common questions: We just throw them in the deep end There''s no real induction, you just pick it up as you go We never got around to a proper welcome pack Nobody told me what ''good'' looked like in this role We do a first-day chat and that''s about it','[0.055466,0.003314,0.062757,0.080488,0.087219,0.052427,-0.036336,0.071852,-0.010244,-0.020588,-0.041842,0.058958,-0.012886,0.002362,0.037014,-0.018606,-0.015578,-0.118573,-0.022153,0.005673,-0.130668,-0.036910,-0.030547,0.047386,-0.046150,0.006963,-0.029583,0.006125,-0.037204,-0.036400,-0.038586,0.030432,0.067112,0.024296,0.070591,0.039533,0.072967,-0.007923,-0.038725,-0.067957,0.054987,-0.115929,-0.065987,0.022280,0.018507,-0.061469,0.013705,-0.047107,-0.056010,0.003262,-0.095687,-0.079613,0.054810,-0.034339,-0.031209,0.066343,0.013795,-0.018441,0.036735,-0.076312,-0.059444,-0.040885,-0.018862,0.029633,0.051582,0.040858,-0.013446,-0.025174,0.001190,0.093261,-0.032873,-0.080782,-0.100621,0.063577,0.045753,0.055837,0.039686,0.031062,0.095108,-0.067261,-0.062549,0.015168,-0.095961,0.080246,-0.027755,0.002897,0.062874,0.018429,-0.004106,0.006298,0.061396,-0.045936,0.038983,0.012822,-0.004483,0.051316,-0.074780,-0.008522,-0.074571,0.030470,0.059466,0.103711,0.065131,-0.034135,-0.071394,-0.025692,0.027223,-0.065898,-0.053485,-0.103060,-0.000695,-0.024310,0.029209,-0.027256,0.029181,0.016981,-0.056425,0.052235,0.033407,0.025104,0.020413,0.035925,0.073148,-0.036919,-0.059555,0.005860,-0.034943,0.000000,0.001877,-0.032965,-0.022239,0.068639,0.040475,-0.096544,0.027214,0.004753,0.018940,0