  ('PM4','No feedback / no documentation trail. Performance. SME managers, often promoted for technical skill not people skill, avoid direct feedback conversations and let issues fester until they become a crisis, then want to move straight to dismissal. Because nothing was ever raised or documented, the eventual dismissal looks — and legally is — procedurally unfair, since Fair Work Commission unfair dismissal criteria explicitly weigh whether the employee was notified of the reason and given a chance to respond before any action. Common questions: I''ve mentioned it to them a few times, does that count as a warning? I don''t want to make it awkward, we''re a small team Can I just let them go, everyone knows they''re not pulling their weight We''ve never actually put anything in writing I''ve been too nice for too long','[0.035517,0.068940,0.070524,0.123440,0.116177,0.019960,0.041202,0.061052,0.017923,-0.028854,-0.017222,-0.003055,0.019039,0.049062,-0.045756,0.021019,0.025364,0.026556,-0.006376,-0.032394,0.020741,0.000646,-0.047471,0.036952,-0.041459,-0.048789,0.017849,0.038215,-0.080135,0.009157,-0.093942,0.045743,0.015376,0.037929,0.023537,-0.046643,0.062005,-0.016649,0.010716,-0.105200,0.092042,-0.042985,0.010803,-0.005426,-0.001806,-0.033292,0.033116,-0.068489,-0.181169,-0.032048,-0.033124,-0.095578,0.072978,-0.043128,-0.009174,-0.000454,-0.011880,-0.049449,0.038940,-0.042091,0.001430,-0.094526,-0.067765,-0.004075,0.045155,0.004909,0.013762,-0.062685,-0.006320,0.057330,-0.013892,-0.075678,0.003829,0.074944,-0.036220,0.039798,0.022424,0.065115,0.031692,-0.054393,-0.037629,-0.025340,-0.017754,0.011538,-0.067066,-0.036547,0.035037,0.009747,0.035431,0.022967,0.094648,0.035378,-0.092684,0.025532,-0.028419,-0.040645,-0.027369,0.018107,-0.014825,0.062623,0.011742,0.076533,-0.062099,-0.062576,0.016466,-0.047101,0.015613,0.023342,-0.062741,-0.099886,-0.027592,-0.007982,-0.060232,-0.026418,0.003224,0.057804,-0.014045,0.073584,-0.077310,-0.013912,0.011618,-0.007203,0.0108