  ('PM8','Unfair dismissal & Small Business Fair Dismissal Code. Termination. Unfair dismissal is the single largest category of Fair Work Commission lodgment — **37% of all applications in both 2023–24 and 2024–25**, with FWC receiving 44,075 total lodgments in 2024–25 and an **11% year-on-year increase** in unfair dismissal applications. For a small business employer (<15 employees), compliance with the **Small Business Fair Dismissal Code is a complete defence** if followed — but the Code still requires a valid reason and (for performance) a prior warning; it is not a free pass to dismiss without process, a very common misconception. Common questions: We''re under 15 people so we''re covered, aren''t we? Can they even take us to Fair Work if we followed the Code? It''s cheaper to just pay them out than fight it Filing a claim only costs them like $90, so everyone does it We got a conciliation notice out of nowhere','[-0.017728,0.052007,0.034624,-0.017450,0.064890,0.038682,0.004578,0.038546,-0.033469,0.005276,0.022315,0.029753,-0.048275,0.019514,-0.013650,0.003350,0.072146,0.046174,-0.030681,-0.032202,0.014777,-0.001619,-0.086208,0.062016,-0.047878,-0.046532,-0.006243,0.022569,0.012100,-0.032956,-0.019058,0.060997,0.045328,0.003699,0.047005,-0.024526,-0.038007,-0.036120,0.036882,0.009454,0.009588,-0.009769,-0.028185,-0.026238,0.006736,-0.065196,-0.011358,-0.035387,-0.128023,0.012390,0.065628,0.003415,0.025983,0.078834,-0.005587,-0.119878,-0.054767,-0.090668,-0.007679,0.030584,-0.028352,-0.056392,-0.020313,0.011774,0.098872,-0.015838,-0.060461,-0.086730,-0.066262,-0.037801,-0.003903,-0.065888,-0.046788,0.128563,0.041136,-0.018311,-0.013455,0.015102,0.065721,-0.050371,-0.045052,-0.008659,-0.045995,0.061620,-0.080863,-0.048191,0.039366,-0.010949,0.051807,0.003643,0.115296,0.094973,0.011032,-0.003945,-0.018512,-0.065405,0.020018,0.014658,-0.012115,0.042571,0.016272,-0.017219,-0.051143,-0.029022,0.023404,-0.045512,0.079845,-0.023280,-0.020801,-0.075605,-0.054781,0.0181