  ('PM11','Notice periods & final pay errors. Termination. NES minimum notice scales with continuous service (up to 4 weeks, plus an extra week for employees over 45 with 2+ years'' service), and casuals are not entitled to notice. Awards or contracts can require longer notice than the NES minimum. SMEs frequently get final pay wrong — miscalculating notice-in-lieu, missing accrued leave entitlements, or applying the wrong notice period for tenure — which converts an otherwise clean termination into an underpayment dispute layered on top of any dismissal claim. Common questions: How much notice do we actually owe them? Do we pay out their notice or have them work it? What do we owe on top of notice, just leave? They''ve been here two years, is that different to someone at six months?','[-0.015896,0.051359,0.098692,-0.004503,0.049759,0.032874,-0.041018,0.014191,0.029147,0.024279,0.005550,-0.012284,-0.026547,-0.012421,-0.059511,-0.040633,0.018251,0.034497,0.042852,-0.062788,0.042147,-0.002884,-0.047961,0.024765,0.015220,0.019011,0.002579,0.017963,0.037640,-0.013519,-0.046697,0.023527,0.078655,0.006562,-0.022959,-0.029568,0.010111,-0.082942,0.025835,-0.114826,0.066779,0.048257,-0.003014,0.052244,-0.005915,0.000218,0.022663,-0.052102,-0.120275,0.054645,0.001159,-0.057207,0.073015,0.100407,-0.019245,-0.069230,0.040781,-0.006492,-0.039424,0.071356,-0.038549,-0.030457,-0.083991,-0.017602,0.011767,-0.024142,0.016007,-0.029638,-0.035311,0.050903,-0.086386,-0.051080,-0.023324,0.055892,-0.016896,0.115823,0.018368,0.066801,-0.002167,-0.082317,-0.046179,-0.008000,0.040520,-0.024463,0.066329,-0.079711,0.022607,0.042076,0.059734,0.038986,0.078410,0.046972,0.065066,-0.074588,-0.000159,-0.023812,-0.006035,0.035932,-0.041848,-0.012690,0.007940,0.067458,-0.021545,0.020635,0.090656,0.009968,-0.043701,-0.024600,-0.058923,-0.017195,-0.041413,-0.020755,0.010336,-0.073642,0.101678,0.070411,0.013405,0.116446,0.088501,0.001908,0.035697,0.063763,-0.124877,-0.034746,-0.044048,0.106191,0.016314