  ('PM16','Defensible informal/low-level investigation. Conflict. Most SME "investigations" are informal — a bullying complaint, a clash between two staff, an allegation of unfair treatment — but still need a basically fair process: act promptly, document the complaint, interview complainant/accused/witnesses separately, give the accused details of the allegation and a chance to respond, weigh the evidence, and act on findings. Owners without HR training often either do nothing (fearing they''ll make it worse) or act too fast on one side''s account alone. Common questions: I don''t know who''s telling the truth here Do I need to formally ''investigate'' this or can I just talk to them both? How do I stay impartial when I know them both personally? What do I actually need to write down? Someone''s made a complaint, what happens now?','[-0.047396,0.087667,0.004835,0.064283,0.125119,-0.017115,-0.029596,-0.015600,-0.005696,0.018527,0.023583,-0.007153,-0.036649,0.021192,-0.068501,-0.045916,0.003178,-0.008706,0.015614,-0.011609,-0.088914,-0.089415,-0.001942,-0.060238,-0.060488,-0.032160,0.001583,-0.002938,-0.024992,-0.063641,0.016602,0.069144,0.020333,0.048548,0.064059,0.011979,0.093223,0.023912,-0.011700,-0.054510,0.016239,-0.078995,-0.011646,-0.074230,-0.044892,0.011173,0.043806,-0.008519,-0.090723,-0.024174,-0.072136,-0.089897,0.079307,0.032255,-0.030237,-0.024253,0.051770,-0.017333,0.018104,0.028297,0.034588,-0.056421,-0.096230,0.010088,0.023132,-0.033439,0.013707,0.051285,0.081762,-0.012719,0.031476,-0.064614,-0.083860,0.057906,0.017344,-0.012101,-0.061755,0.013860,0.079609,-0.009461,-0.045611,0.002337,-0.044984,0.093898,-0.040014,-0.042146,0.004839,0.035865,-0.003495,0.049257,-0.023276,0.063433,-0.024134,-0.092995,0.084955,-0.016796,0.029611,0.130090,-0.052413,0.074038,0.026725,0.098536,-0.012502,-0.065972,0.008598,0.007370,-0.007361,-0.060914,-0.026519,-0.034077,-0.024514,0.005640,-0.027782,-0.011366,0.111972,-0.011467,0.005520,0.017509,-0.066891,-0.050840,0.041013