  ('RA1','Whether to hire at all (backfill vs redesign vs automate). Workforce need. When a role becomes vacant (resignation, growth pressure, "we''re drowning"), the SME owner/manager must decide whether to simply refill the same job, redesign it, split it across existing staff, outsource/automate it, or use temporary/contract cover while deciding. Without an HR function, this decision is usually made reactively and fast, under operational pressure. Common questions: Do I actually need to replace her or can we just restructure? We''re drowning, I need someone yesterday. Can I get away with not backfilling this one? Should this be a full-time role or can I get a contractor/temp to cover it for now? Is this a hiring problem or a systems problem?','[-0.110959,-0.001274,0.046876,0.033031,0.020255,0.036090,-0.055385,-0.003454,0.001728,0.027481,-0.081493,0.008166,-0.071900,-0.027367,-0.002714,-0.001206,0.032580,0.001155,-0.016063,-0.049622,-0.064246,-0.088913,-0.083489,-0.059428,-0.021849,-0.009042,0.011239,0.030135,-0.050426,-0.076035,-0.038726,0.032577,0.001818,0.037181,0.063984,0.120647,-0.025768,0.069899,-0.043462,-0.038775,0.005415,-0.096808,-0.091862,0.018967,-0.018874,0.013268,0.012442,-0.008764,-0.016690,-0.015728,0.003081,-0.050147,-0.048328,0.044403,0.002481,0.029155,0.072561,-0.022716,0.015714,-0.042072,0.028270,0.053651,-0.023876,0.029127,0.037007,-0.099991,-0.045681,-0.059698,0.017417,0.074215,0.019243,-0.002646,-0.061568,-0.007958,0.088372,-0.010691,0.045859,0.007173,0.095947,0.025566,0.034955,-0.015277,0.045477,0.082477,-0.042989,-0.040216,-0.039983,-0.015744,0.112333,-0.031153,0.017298,0.078934,0.024246,-0.030090,-0.003435,0.075721,-0.085079,0.106917,-0.003831,0.018106,-0.038227,0.052637,0.059545,-0.055187,-0.000173,-0.049662,0.026532,0.001271,0.020078,-0.086392,0.030327,-0.025054,0.013783,0.025931,0.066941,0.025729,-0.057944,0.003593,-0.033710,-0.020431,0.025640,0.014226,-0.076738,-0.049864,0.002079,-0.037350,-0.028316,0.000000,-0.048259,0.102477,0.03995