  ('RA3','Vague need -> accurate job description. Role design. The owner/manager knows the business is understaffed or a function is failing but struggles to translate "I need help" into a structured description of duties, required skills, reporting lines, and success measures. JDs are frequently copy-pasted from an old ad, a template found online, or a competitor''s listing rather than built from actual task analysis. Common questions: I know what I need them to do, I just don''t know how to write it up properly. Can you turn this into a proper position description for me? What do I even call this role? I''ve just copied our old ad from two years ago, is that still right?','[-0.021783,0.092684,0.037665,-0.036365,-0.041770,0.010404,0.062893,0.027895,-0.117526,-0.089014,-0.055050,-0.027370,-0.046245,0.061255,-0.032450,-0.001882,0.083171,-0.004505,-0.016910,0.014822,0.053490,0.003424,0.061625,0.001553,-0.078965,0.035429,0.026821,-0.007115,-0.043089,-0.054605,0.052979,-0.029813,0.074527,0.058603,0.051066,0.110193,-0.031248,0.041857,0.005274,0.002206,-0.056438,-0.009140,-0.005963,0.037674,-0.002285,-0.104877,0.015834,-0.074903,0.035009,0.015808,-0.088195,-0.003882,0.015890,-0.044982,0.026368,0.109437,0.033044,-0.028658,-0.065621,-0.037346,0.025851,0.032235,0.014757,0.059847,0.008276,-0.000575,-0.067087,0.042279,-0.058517,-0.002753,-0.114111,0.012374,-0.063072,0.017819,-0.042037,-0.015339,0.021090,0.046048,0.019537,-0.025435,-0.007232,0.015349,-0.067795,0.127552,0.008203,-0.014521,0.021190,-0.037382,0.035359,0.019045,0.022139,-0.084104,0.008812,-0.025970,0.016812,0.061988,0.035755,-0.014052,-0.029981,-0.003860,0.007462,-0.010117,0.075599,-0.066871,-0.104353,-0.000852,-0.078912,0.088202,-0.052269,-0.021879,0.027288,-0.041805,-0.128515,-0.025404,0.030949,-0.034771,-0.073713,0.003888,0.027497,-0.011671,0.003811,0.072021,-0.053353,0.018433,-0.012036,0.036256,-0.003303,0.000000,-0.009565,0.050291,0.037842,0.143585,0.004057,-0.033030,-0.005314,0.060701,-0.001730,0.080524,0.014