  ('RA7','Avoiding discriminatory language/criteria in ads. Job ads. Ads must avoid direct or indirect discrimination on protected attributes (age, sex, disability, race, sexual orientation, gender identity, pregnancy, family/carer responsibilities, etc.) both in explicit wording ("under 30," "recent graduate only") and in disguised proxies (unnecessary experience thresholds, physical requirements not genuinely required for the job). Common questions: Can I say we''re looking for someone young and energetic? Is it okay to ask for ''native English speaker''? We really want someone who''s been in the industry a long time, is that discriminatory against younger people? Can I ask if they have kids, just so I know about their availability?','[0.005790,0.048195,0.024741,0.008416,0.075429,0.035331,0.102813,-0.049652,-0.063635,-0.068437,0.007014,-0.102023,-0.044529,0.019178,0.096065,0.003418,0.112840,0.044678,0.025786,-0.059375,0.050058,0.015676,-0.023315,-0.011898,0.009508,-0.118669,0.024098,-0.018115,-0.021281,0.083055,0.033852,0.021361,0.061374,0.021055,0.041617,-0.018183,-0.079231,-0.008015,-0.034838,-0.003066,-0.119818,-0.084649,-0.060131,-0.032894,0.037803,-0.092811,0.053650,0.056536,-0.032936,-0.021396,-0.033226,-0.044356,0.029338,0.014108,-0.050103,-0.016502,-0.065202,-0.001818,0.001888,0.023140,-0.073126,-0.066215,-0.024234,0.089809,-0.037495,-0.009860,-0.017044,0.004035,0.029857,0.020600,-0.014394,0.030144,-0.052671,0.098095,0.038552,-0.001405,0.037234,-0.006756,0.042548,-0.038757,0.073544,-0.082403,-0.069192,0.017432,0.049811,-0.033812,-0.035773,-0.057113,-0.027468,-0.002577,-0.000528,0.030164,-0.012605,0.006930,0.061654,-0.111078,0.022430,0.031628,-0.028636,0.021782,-0.074451,-0.017491,0.059036,0.063273,-0.101283,-0.023460,-0.032082,0.053487,0.022643,0.042762,-0.024148,0.038554,-0.016949,0.041098,0.048998,-0.053370,0.030102,-0.054774,0.077260,0.017824,-0.093651,0.095616,-0.045372,-0.040058,-0.009996,-0.062748,0.025245,0.000000,0.086240,0.097555,-0.013579,0.02275