  ('RA8','Right ad channel(s) & cost as an SME. Job ads. SMEs must pick between SEEK, Indeed, LinkedIn, niche/industry boards, social media, referral, or an agency — each with different cost structures, reach, and fit by role type — usually without any prior data on what has worked before. Common questions: Where should I even post this? Is SEEK worth the money or should I just use Indeed for free? Should I use a recruiter for this one or try to do it myself first? LinkedIn feels like it''s for corporate roles, not us.','[-0.050362,-0.109261,-0.021681,0.025392,0.063816,0.022201,0.045936,0.031536,0.018916,-0.044428,-0.066541,0.027983,-0.041919,0.027215,0.084237,-0.091174,0.069718,-0.008985,0.064176,-0.061075,-0.005240,-0.010422,-0.031503,-0.060118,0.024564,-0.171215,-0.001310,-0.000695,-0.013276,-0.035971,-0.015910,0.071557,-0.032180,-0.013688,0.011793,0.013652,-0.071942,-0.053885,-0.051944,0.010849,0.015642,-0.089282,-0.062308,-0.029910,-0.040163,-0.031542,0.097279,0.095110,0.042921,0.009728,-0.107079,-0.094187,0.021070,0.025772,-0.132598,0.020839,-0.032138,-0.034643,-0.010933,-0.017054,-0.000097,-0.007166,0.010276,0.006471,0.047119,0.030230,-0.054916,0.061775,0.025525,-0.117120,0.012134,-0.047125,-0.083113,0.084441,0.021426,-0.046199,0.045945,0.002427,0.038820,-0.024665,0.015145,-0.010580,-0.129024,0.072527,0.007768,-0.003466,0.045613,-0.001387,0.012863,0.069987,0.002532,0.084232,-0.026977,-0.034396,0.094878,0.009407,-0.072128,0.043738,-0.013804,-0.012484,-0.031135,-0.008761,0.003254,-0.010718,-0.041058,0.008327,-0.028458,0.085362,0.155718,0.074598,-0.047433,0.033428,-0.043434,-0.013613,0.054178,-0.029149,-0.053138,0.029330,0.082162,-0.044837,-0.059215,0.073024,0.031171,-0.033457,0.007826,-0.042520,-0.055964,0.000000,0.009214,0.114102,0.080001,-0.052872,-0.076378,0.003827,-0.073628,0.024591,-0.062608,0.027000,-0.076101,0.039922,-0.036656,0.072584,0.019060,-0.070588,0.029434,0.009939,-0.013067,-0.026775,-0.016835,0.068022,-0.082239,0.067518,0.064052,-0.062432,0.0093