  ('RA9','Credible EVP as a low-brand-recognition employer. EVP. SMEs must articulate why someone should work for them when they can''t compete on brand recognition or, often, on headline salary — requiring them to identify and communicate genuine differentiators (flexibility, autonomy, growth, culture, purpose, job security in a stable local business). Common questions: Why would anyone want to work here over a bigger company? We can''t compete on salary, what else have we got? Nobody''s heard of us, how do I make the ad sound appealing? We''re a great little team, I just don''t know how to say that in an ad.','[0.018655,0.023511,-0.010708,-0.022797,0.079904,-0.005116,0.060249,0.005187,-0.051815,-0.090123,-0.021429,-0.002227,0.000931,-0.029499,-0.019527,-0.040901,0.100851,-0.039523,0.054781,-0.009027,-0.109609,-0.042514,-0.043620,-0.010893,0.019985,-0.025631,0.030675,0.089077,-0.022169,-0.062611,0.065429,-0.021339,0.070358,-0.081624,0.093953,0.060138,0.002779,-0.025321,-0.010570,-0.038253,0.074430,-0.087100,-0.116685,-0.075214,-0.017336,-0.047034,0.089491,0.061568,-0.061495,-0.013376,-0.031805,-0.058178,0.026455,-0.117574,-0.087828,0.015930,-0.023190,-0.044479,-0.032654,0.010605,-0.013048,-0.012181,-0.028106,0.098838,0.047909,-0.042089,-0.008629,0.046813,-0.139534,-0.044734,0.028787,-0.047787,-0.043959,0.122272,0.009946,-0.007530,0.024478,-0.063690,0.118922,0.024357,0.025292,-0.058636,-0.169025,0.053085,0.001538,-0.055578,0.014027,-0.035342,-0.044129,0.073356,0.021664,-0.003192,-0.055765,0.014257,0.008233,0.017622,-0.028519,-0.013156,0.012038,0.015102,-0.073292,0.049818,0.031692,-0.053386,-0.048405,-0.079973,0.009898,0.023640,0.098885,0.055952,0.012173,0.037256,-0.069114,-0.002012,0.054647,-0.016944,-0.064891,0.021131,0.030291,-0.090439,-0.047539,0.014766,-0.064292,-0.033128,0.014711,0.041198,-0.006979,0.000000,-0.040616,0.119742,0.015467,0.004111,0.004476,-0.009057,-0.019165,0.001994,-0.064837,0.056377,0.014676,0.093876,0.093046,0.043537,0.054978,0.027076,-0.03923