  ('RA10','"Ghost job" perception & trust erosion. Job ads. Two related phenomena: (a) genuine employers'' ads being mistaken for "ghost jobs" (roles with no real intent to hire, often posted for pipeline-building or to project growth) because candidates hear nothing back; (b) SME employers themselves losing time to candidates who apply speculatively or without real intent. Rising candidate distrust of job ads generally raises the bar for SME ads to look credible and prompt. Common questions: I haven''t had time to get back to everyone who applied. People are saying we never responded, but we''re just flat out. How do I know if the people applying are even serious? Is this job even still open? [candidate-side, illustrative]','[-0.056924,-0.060033,0.023755,0.022885,0.102083,-0.040775,0.038628,-0.067045,-0.027126,-0.122237,-0.017502,0.030976,0.016465,-0.068125,-0.003496,-0.033595,0.042358,0.035134,-0.005003,-0.039839,-0.067768,-0.013478,-0.053289,-0.009534,0.026082,-0.094945,-0.001339,-0.042497,-0.082320,-0.045453,0.021229,0.068404,-0.016429,-0.048643,0.120382,0.013002,-0.058226,0.017582,-0.039960,-0.059539,0.057261,-0.032690,-0.003496,-0.065025,-0.083549,-0.081910,0.099636,-0.016703,-0.015837,-0.054399,-0.041973,-0.058551,0.071653,-0.015697,-0.075276,0.009853,0.007715,0.063058,-0.033834,0.037850,0.015168,-0.049785,-0.052520,0.021472,0.020505,0.042006,-0.047878,-0.065505,0.043478,-0.003406,0.038724,0.026657,-0.088336,-0.013145,0.052247,-0.029408,0.021611,-0.018645,0.052237,0.007809,0.022954,-0.081985,-0.116089,0.045908,-0.031656,-0.053417,-0.018264,-0.028108,0.043126,0.022332,0.027346,0.010414,-0.084775,0.033059,0.018239,-0.051328,-0.011473,0.143338,0.001512,0.026780,-0.094938,-0.001677,0.030359,-0.007760,0.024005,0.021806,-0.040319,-0.002368,0.024081,0.052243,-0.064512,0.016648,0.011212,0.040569,0.006883,0.015165,0.014426,-0.058383,-0.032211,-0.014805,0.020288,0.088961,0.036054,-0.065813,0.064882,-0.024773,0.005248,0.000000,-0.020664,0.097105,0.017538,-0.040184,0.014