  ('RA13','Avoiding illegal/underpaid job-ad rates (FWO). Pay banding/compliance. It is a specific, enforceable offence in Australia to advertise a job at a pay rate below the applicable minimum entitlement under an Award, enterprise agreement, or the National Minimum Wage. This is distinct from D1/D2 — it is a hard compliance floor, not a competitiveness question. Common questions: I didn''t realise the award had gone up. We''ve always paid this rate, I didn''t know it wasn''t enough anymore. What award even covers this role? Can I offer a flat rate that covers penalties, or do I have to itemise it?','[-0.034492,0.069164,-0.093157,-0.014084,0.036261,0.086171,0.035064,-0.002118,-0.056854,0.016712,0.013068,-0.042779,0.001718,0.070663,0.020279,0.026714,0.037930,-0.009622,0.022972,-0.057866,-0.035625,0.065466,0.002017,-0.059886,0.039675,-0.123188,-0.019033,0.061294,-0.007540,-0.040911,-0.005657,0.079580,0.103071,0.012471,0.013365,-0.064759,0.015328,-0.082275,-0.034308,-0.001924,0.048930,-0.044290,-0.043089,-0.081811,-0.009656,-0.024983,0.082122,0.068842,-0.104365,0.052902,0.065535,0.003378,0.028099,0.034457,-0.032653,-0.061219,0.036134,0.014102,-0.085867,-0.012949,-0.004386,-0.056212,-0.070282,0.048027,-0.016260,-0.018661,-0.074036,-0.029654,-0.050290,0.061707,-0.026996,-0.072881,-0.010428,-0.065181,0.075215,-0.016819,0.003636,0.075479,0.112507,-0.043114,0.035394,-0.089497,-0.036579,-0.002405,0.034849,-0.095326,0.028369,-0.040835,0.058135,0.012554,0.008194,-0.014672,0.000655,0.010769,0.009192,-0.079580,-0.017390,0.043411,-0.024168,0.021780,-0.045856,-0.006614,-0.060817,0.025730,-0.014602,-0.019613,0.020713,0.083381,0.041546,0.025833,0.003247,0.089533,0.026608,-0.003128,-0.046227,0.043312,-0.046585,0.051121,0.114609,-0.041837,0.045076,0.064623,-0.059256,-0.025703,0.001614,-0.019358,-0.032002,-0.000000,0.052327,0.070456,0.009118,-0.118868,0.086091,-0.043730,-0.025256,0.018524,0.029022,0.076299,-0.018055,0.060199,0.063114,-0.017615,0.060971,0.002280,-0.062236,0.060162,0.0