  ('RA17','Employer-sponsored migration as an SME lever. Sourcing. With employer-sponsored permanent migration places increasing substantially for 2026–27 while overall net overseas migration is being deliberately reduced, the government''s stated policy direction favours employer sponsorship as a shortage-filling pathway — but SMEs are typically the least likely business segment to know how to access it, given the cost, complexity, and lead time of sponsorship compared to larger employers with dedicated mobility/HR teams. Common questions: Could I sponsor someone from overseas for this role, and is it even worth the hassle for one person? What does it actually cost me to sponsor someone? I keep hearing there aren''t enough [tradespeople/nurses] here, should I be looking overseas? How long does visa sponsorship actually take, I need someone soon.','[0.020055,-0.029518,0.095021,-0.032151,0.113278,0.050098,-0.017656,0.029701,-0.048277,-0.045565,-0.080794,-0.062842,-0.039451,0.026892,0.015284,0.006862,-0.035591,-0.073195,-0.038889,-0.071342,-0.086279,-0.117433,-0.056013,-0.069163,0.022870,-0.055483,0.051939,-0.016421,-0.001795,0.077201,0.001783,0.047858,-0.060838,0.044867,0.065267,0.041324,-0.003630,-0.023692,-0.035551,-0.023827,0.096245,-0.050496,0.005276,-0.019204,0.031033,-0.033838,0.012985,0.082086,-0.051316,0.047431,-0.043030,-0.104536,0.076451,-0.053685,-0.045072,-0.042573,0.062291,-0.059570,-0.010811,0.021295,0.017890,-0.027037,-0.021582,-0.009262,-0.044166,-0.110181,-0.009547,0.016647,0.003885,-0.015583,-0.001976,-0.092183,-0.091181,0.064808,0.043246,-0.017879,0.006044,0.064620,0.037394,0.010974,0.048512,0.024034,-0.023812,-0.074727,-0.099024,-0.036974,0.024836,0.030967,0.049630,0.137543,-0.017528,-0.038101,-0.027739,0.001118,-0.047908,0.008339,-0.018902,0.074351,-0.041327,0.018693,0.001618,0.006469,0.045613,0.008645,-0.087564,0.019392,-0.019495,0.021313,0.047817,0.056515,-0.034137,0.028809,-0.045256,0.046878,-0.007080,-0.066274,-0.061907,-0.031902,0.100805,-0.