  ('RA18','Time-to-fill blowout & vacancy cost. Sourcing. While the national median time-to-fill sits around 32 days, this masks substantially longer fill times for niche, regional, or shortage-occupation SME vacancies — extending the operational and financial pain (overtime, lost revenue, burnout of remaining staff) that triggered the hire in the first place. Common questions: This role''s been open for months and I still can''t find anyone. We''re all working overtime to cover the gap. I can''t afford to wait for the ''perfect'' person any more, I just need someone. How long is this actually going to take?','[-0.040366,-0.007018,0.076502,0.052729,0.010886,-0.003902,-0.071524,-0.015722,-0.011329,-0.006813,-0.042464,-0.007803,-0.081121,-0.002905,0.069784,0.028260,-0.025193,-0.006393,-0.025485,-0.118640,-0.013122,-0.070448,-0.095637,-0.097738,0.040679,-0.029473,0.000679,-0.037744,0.016773,-0.019692,-0.033014,0.028092,0.029162,0.051617,0.075687,0.013241,-0.064531,0.051633,-0.028018,0.000932,0.064203,-0.024644,-0.025160,0.043286,-0.065286,-0.012592,0.063102,-0.022135,0.008392,-0.004595,0.013811,-0.037631,0.015907,0.041165,-0.030062,0.027636,0.032496,-0.030754,-0.057185,0.031610,-0.028125,-0.021065,-0.019753,0.015361,0.018368,-0.076567,0.015922,-0.020938,-0.071020,0.027451,-0.019258,-0.043423,-0.143114,-0.026088,0.050585,0.013691,0.108885,-0.008021,0.066807,-0.050073,0.087172,0.019952,-0.029200,0.009341,-0.055787,-0.061647,0.041312,0.040114,0.063523,0.003199,-0.012595,0.037201,-0.078075,-0.045703,0.038736,0.016547,-0.016634,0.150526,-0.027852,0.050044,-0.074868,0.017067,-0.038593,-0.072016,-0.049211,-0.022591,-0.017147,0.070289,-0.038069,-0.039674,0.059738,-0.014245,0.088715,-0.048044,0.051862,0.082665,-0.057315,0.017569,0.003712,0.044842,0.056742,0.115009,-0.110273,-0.109024,-0.066278,0.029899,-0.010639,0.000000,0.003162,0.084213,-0.001829,0.112351,-0.026378,-0.034192,0.004460,0.021423,0.037940,0.055707,-0.035718,-0.011402,-0.089786,-0.042772,-0.082559,-0.043629,0.0929