  ('RS1','Resume overload with no triage system. Screening. Easy-apply job boards and AI-written applications mean an SME advertising one role can receive hundreds of applications, most of them low-fit. The owner/manager doing hiring alongside their day job has no formal way to triage volume, so screening either takes days (delaying time-to-hire) or gets rushed and superficial. Common questions: the pile just keeps growing," "I''m drowning in applications," "half of these aren''t even close," "I just skim for keywords," "I don''t have time to read 200 CVs," "we ghost most of them because who has time to reply.','[-0.034404,-0.049188,0.034628,0.021404,0.090905,-0.031494,0.043901,0.032125,-0.105748,-0.035545,-0.028771,-0.006955,-0.026677,-0.036163,0.001629,-0.033853,0.029397,-0.060007,-0.047274,-0.034873,-0.044256,-0.025224,-0.054154,-0.042925,-0.105736,0.018037,-0.044254,-0.072008,0.032006,-0.028723,0.036756,0.099076,0.042002,0.084680,0.117136,0.030259,-0.080718,0.017986,0.021078,-0.033841,0.010632,-0.096924,-0.073757,0.023733,0.056932,-0.077019,-0.000544,0.013415,0.072733,-0.007747,-0.101740,-0.047152,0.061361,-0.009760,-0.066298,0.008969,-0.003955,-0.012869,-0.056063,0.001126,-0.018066,-0.028871,0.005551,0.100881,0.043860,0.054268,-0.079339,0.002824,-0.039107,0.004578,-0.032287,-0.000825,-0.162933,0.117926,-0.001621,-0.028785,0.000056,-0.026241,0.060055,0.000039,-0.041844,-0.074655,-0.034715,0.056922,-0.035688,-0.002474,-0.013302,-0.044662,0.039229,0.015742,0.042592,-0.021274,0.024326,-0.026924,0.003524,-0.011578,0.012965,0.097354,-0.084647,0.031203,-0.021759,0.001978,0.018598,-0.015617,-0.074122,-0.051169,0.033018,0.008241,-0.021170,-0.036285,-0.024944,-0.008120,0.090973,-0.033942,0.020131,0.033642,-0.019050,0.065577,-0.009938,0.078879,0.046777,0.068092,-0.028627,-0.062512,0.030680,0.034587,-0.009344,0.000000,-0.002080,0.095046,-0.027066,0.071261,-0.057015,-0.098785,-0.033538,0.085780,0.058558,0.083071,-0.013146,0.085139,-0.046909,-0.013009,0.034064,-0.016261,0.01