  ('RS2','AI-assisted resume screening & algorithmic bias. Screening. SMEs increasingly buy ATS/screening tools with AI ranking features to cope with volume (A1). These tools learn from historical hiring patterns and can reproduce and amplify bias — screening out candidates based on proxies for race, disability, age or gender (non-Anglo names, employment gaps, postcode, graduation year) rather than job-relevant criteria. Common questions: the software just ranks them for me," "I don''t really know how it scores," "it filters out the ones without the right keywords," "the vendor said it''s bias-free," "black box," "I just trust the shortlist it gives me.','[-0.071259,-0.029509,-0.018331,0.054772,0.101613,0.089050,-0.010901,-0.022417,-0.072481,-0.038373,-0.103063,0.040783,0.025081,-0.038886,-0.094058,0.026479,0.011970,-0.037939,0.014170,-0.066034,-0.049099,-0.012060,-0.007348,-0.092815,0.060709,-0.061059,-0.035173,-0.035267,-0.024581,-0.024806,0.052728,0.054962,0.100027,0.084221,-0.002742,-0.050699,-0.086409,0.035300,0.020427,-0.043608,-0.001989,-0.093667,-0.004926,-0.057607,0.057347,-0.041442,-0.049306,-0.011515,0.001097,0.068679,-0.144511,-0.041002,0.055309,0.038072,-0.087898,0.048080,-0.043589,-0.041779,-0.017366,0.001704,-0.055081,-0.090242,-0.033393,0.084453,0.034726,0.041939,-0.081655,-0.025788,-0.030889,-0.074204,-0.020830,0.031773,-0.033639,0.128996,0.062772,0.057554,0.017358,-0.016578,0.101674,-0.048274,-0.027568,-0.018196,-0.026546,0.090349,0.043122,0.016575,0.031397,-0.074988,-0.004723,0.054811,0.027542,-0.061814,-0.010552,0.015117,0.021713,-0.049422,0.062412,0.050670,0.016738,0.021473,-0.056114,0.015313,0.001419,-0.013519,-0.089801,-0.091564,0.057136,-0.049884,0.044804,-0.053807,0.020555,-0.000348,0.004689,-0.073509,0.047545,-0.047229,0.001961,0.063377,0.026176,0.019981,-0.028351,0.023752,-0.024478,-0.023894,0.041146,0.054421,-0.088663,0.000000,0.001591,-0.009853,-0.006529,0.007398,-0.002377,-0.123005,-0.028896,0.050728,0.023443,0.074893,-0.123253,0.124001