  ('RS3','No consistent CV scoring rubric. Screening. Screening decisions in most SMEs are made against an informal mental checklist rather than a written, weighted rubric applied consistently to every applicant. This produces inconsistent, hard-to-defend outcomes and makes it difficult to demonstrate merit-based selection if challenged. Common questions: I just know it when I see it," "gut feel," "does this person feel right," "we don''t really score, we just talk about it," "gone with my instinct.','[0.006591,-0.033613,-0.085141,0.007147,0.097753,0.020993,0.069813,-0.014172,-0.036360,-0.035024,-0.037491,0.035621,-0.019477,0.015120,-0.053613,-0.036798,-0.000508,-0.045992,0.025926,0.028309,-0.115173,-0.027390,0.030074,-0.083987,-0.027803,-0.066521,-0.042769,0.000422,-0.044749,-0.039683,0.032590,0.066507,0.059590,0.077186,-0.005871,-0.036217,-0.059552,0.037119,-0.024191,-0.004911,0.007613,-0.130153,-0.028100,-0.044860,0.011970,-0.092071,-0.024207,-0.013606,-0.041326,-0.026145,-0.165697,-0.018228,0.031957,0.006477,-0.044675,0.010479,0.010568,-0.025338,-0.009993,-0.038798,-0.050887,-0.066667,-0.027105,0.057160,0.137807,0.026647,-0.061044,-0.044391,0.018313,-0.002772,-0.016322,-0.019304,-0.039657,0.126616,0.042851,0.089627,0.016157,-0.013112,0.030780,0.032158,-0.069533,0.037498,-0.076647,0.019439,0.045621,0.020132,0.034103,-0.039912,0.031483,0.085081,0.060019,-0.016404,-0.053340,-0.001522,0.001093,0.031726,-0.057879,-0.009339,-0.065040,0.011098,0.002501,0.048735,-0.018083,-0.055140,0.011831,-0.047530,0.064121,0.021958,-0.033291,-0.063697,-0.028651,0.085846,0.058734,-0.027745,0.008346,-0.011376,0.030154,0.081475,0.016448,0.020445,-0.005417,0.065558,0.025477,-0.066000,0.008556,-0.013007,-0.068675,0.000000,0.033623,0.000325,0.027532,-0.013278,-0.104457,-0.056256,-0.074620,0.041696,0.067515,0.096039,0.031671,0.051137,0.052502,0.050395,0.046587,0.091927,-0.042054,0.050789,-0.023767,0.011528,0.019416,-0.032872,0.011846,-0.037956,0.004963,-0.024330,0.006673,0.051867,-0.014012,