  ('RS4','Undocumented, indefensible shortlisting. Shortlisting. Shortlisting is where the applicant pool is cut to interview-stage, and it is the point at which discrimination complaints most often crystallise ("why was I not even interviewed?"). Many SMEs shortlist informally — a quick read-through and a verbal "let''s talk to these three" — with no written rationale for who was cut and why. Common questions: we had a chat and picked our top three," "I could just tell from the CV," "didn''t feel like a culture fit," "not what we''re looking for" (used without a stated reason), "we''ll just go with our shortlist.','[-0.046964,0.065837,0.034652,0.070780,0.173893,0.024373,0.078023,0.000012,-0.019937,-0.078889,-0.046548,-0.020602,-0.063637,-0.053907,0.037173,-0.055396,0.004262,0.031544,-0.042319,-0.037223,0.021133,0.053835,-0.055480,0.027406,-0.008256,-0.051663,-0.003447,-0.011857,0.002354,0.009539,-0.013196,0.130764,0.151143,0.105776,-0.026532,-0.034373,-0.063210,0.007004,-0.036059,-0.037298,-0.023583,-0.050053,-0.010247,0.005347,-0.065667,-0.040709,0.011086,-0.018087,-0.076409,-0.031829,-0.095570,-0.008763,-0.018635,0.021612,-0.045760,-0.050669,-0.081742,0.007757,-0.066046,0.077864,-0.016699,-0.116159,-0.028626,0.075839,0.065681,-0.018915,-0.042508,0.021207,-0.009021,0.028654,-0.042193,-0.000340,-0.112716,0.107482,0.039775,0.039818,0.053973,0.004891,-0.022936,-0.024355,-0.047842,-0.068102,-0.054331,0.050159,-0.017326,-0.077535,-0.037373,-0.062517,-0.051719,0.037377,0.040983,-0.046644,0.004626,-0.012110,0.044832,-0.010841,-0.000512,0.052224,-0.109404,0.009566,0.034597,0.060623,-0.040335,-0.017745,-0.021844,-0.102134,0.002071,-0.093502,-0.085354,-0.039034,-0.048226,0.119009,0.054200,-0.057665,0.002043,-0.003117,0.020671,0.017698,0.028569,0.064404,-0.072707,0.058006,-0.026936,-0.037392,0.002487,0.029858,-0.054786,-0.000000,0.005122,0.046628,-0.002269,-0.043130,-0.013021,-0.003721,-0.088145,-0.014129,-0.023826,0.074438,0.078442,0.020625,0.068674,0.046112,0.033916,0.0549