  ('RS5','Inconsistent, unstructured phone screens. Phone/video screen. Initial phone screens in SMEs are typically freeform 10-15 minute chats rather than a structured set of questions applied to every candidate. This makes it hard to compare candidates objectively and increases the risk that unconscious bias, rapport, or unlawful topics (family status, age, health) creep into the conversation. Common questions: just a quick chat to see if they''re keen," "suss them out," "gauge their vibe," "quick sense check before we bring them in," "weed out the time-wasters.','[-0.058602,0.009341,0.045451,-0.045751,0.091682,-0.009025,0.065224,0.017110,0.082798,-0.071851,-0.023699,-0.015874,-0.048311,-0.001274,0.046773,-0.081271,0.108873,-0.153086,-0.053960,0.052194,-0.018863,-0.036512,0.002875,-0.079184,0.011529,-0.075069,-0.032030,0.001599,0.000452,0.000936,-0.012313,0.093455,0.118340,0.147437,-0.054641,-0.047789,-0.031851,0.055304,-0.069406,-0.028960,-0.082902,-0.097607,0.012462,-0.014412,-0.029983,-0.088695,-0.031804,0.021391,-0.002113,-0.022268,-0.134621,-0.042554,0.037849,0.092422,-0.050192,0.051907,-0.085704,0.064138,0.042027,0.078208,-0.075852,-0.046689,-0.032087,0.040377,0.018070,0.093859,-0.025133,-0.032865,0.034735,0.013873,-0.085013,0.004314,-0.083679,0.081355,-0.028762,0.009794,-0.003260,-0.057298,0.005933,-0.002680,-0.019752,-0.006931,-0.026202,0.007076,0.035504,-0.022913,-0.010291,0.017291,-0.041070,-0.002922,-0.089319,0.064902,-0.049374,0.009213,-0.003533,0.013042,-0.037123,0.035259,-0.032683,0.053205,-0.002967,0.052748,0.025428,-0.002746,-0.040800,-0.036077,-0.001967,-0.028114,-0.032314,0.047874,-0.026258,0.013899,0.021107,-0.018247,0.040070,-0.051254,0.022184,0.002431,0.025019,0.023477,0.041741,-0.021811,-0.051160,-0.066892,0.032100,0.021100,-0.028281,0.000000,0.027882,0.054608,-0.006012,0.102604,0.003258,0.054543,-0.041876,0.032639,0.026698,0.057586,-0.006628,0.024994,0.010376,-0.011013,0.058156,-0.059972,-0.050289,0.078238,-0.050968,-0.058780,-0.025228,-0.05