  ('RS6','One-way AI video interviews - backlash & legal footing. Phone/video screen. Some SMEs (often via a recruitment agency or platform) now use one-way, asynchronous video interviews where candidates record themselves answering set questions, sometimes with AI-generated scoring of tone, word choice or facial expression. Candidates report finding these impersonal and are increasingly wary of how the recording and any biometric-adjacent data (face, voice) is used, stored and possibly used to train vendor models. Common questions: record yourself answering these three questions," "the AI gives us a score out of 100," "candidates hate these," "feels like talking to a wall," "creepy," "no idea what happens to the video after.','[-0.097279,-0.012819,-0.025064,0.000865,0.058049,0.019702,0.040800,-0.004934,0.028297,-0.086999,-0.056348,-0.081496,0.012747,-0.039059,0.008241,-0.023333,0.056800,-0.041098,-0.038559,0.014137,-0.017059,-0.027031,0.044054,-0.030566,-0.002051,-0.079130,-0.017548,-0.030847,0.042613,-0.029473,0.041321,0.025527,0.026949,0.134300,-0.064976,-0.018541,-0.029426,0.024008,-0.051011,-0.012480,-0.005921,-0.026154,0.016797,-0.044553,0.026130,-0.003004,-0.085201,0.041798,0.019709,0.009254,-0.140889,-0.000174,0.009027,0.017282,-0.098814,0.021784,-0.017512,0.071303,-0.013892,0.087561,0.017084,-0.086898,-0.006229,0.045210,0.044114,0.055745,-0.025024,-0.060440,-0.028296,-0.020843,-0.082043,-0.026634,-0.069429,0.056032,0.017010,-0.026590,-0.018304,-0.061721,0.067427,0.003292,0.013275,-0.084764,0.035940,0.020681,0.014669,-0.003483,0.000461,0.008852,0.014605,0.043191,-0.113028,-0.025868,0.041883,-0.053512,0.083358,0.046037,-0.045707,0.036179,0.022063,-0.001954,-0.019790,0.043527,-0.013118,0.029038,-0.036295,-0.033765,-0.006431,-0.040536,0.101127,-0.015608,-0.027811,0.017474,0.033392,-0.053720,0.081956,-0.004826,-0.064530,0.135826,0.008827,-0.000982,-0.035544,-0.038711,-0.003641,-0.021580,0.043742,-0.051951,-0.008942,0.000000,0.059804,0.040246,0.041800,0.006000,0.