  ('RS8','Unstructured, gut-feel interviewing. Interview design. Most SME interviews are conversational and unstructured: different questions for different candidates, no fixed rubric, decisions driven by rapport and first impressions rather than evidence against job-relevant criteria. This is the single biggest driver of both poor hiring decisions and legal exposure in the interview stage. Common questions: I just go with my gut," "you know within the first five minutes," "we just have a chat," "didn''t feel right," "loved their energy," "not sure why, just a vibe thing.','[-0.026344,0.031407,0.075663,0.048621,0.131673,-0.078368,0.016800,0.028739,0.082434,-0.049736,-0.118375,-0.009374,-0.110519,-0.057467,0.066943,-0.047007,0.075684,-0.074590,-0.048964,0.043270,-0.077086,0.010926,-0.006268,-0.070060,0.012212,-0.032310,0.007784,0.004160,0.033993,-0.021050,0.022179,0.054876,0.110909,0.151124,0.013290,0.031331,-0.011509,0.024721,-0.031404,-0.038160,-0.043264,-0.085412,-0.033293,-0.020279,-0.029633,-0.134791,-0.015618,-0.000195,-0.035262,-0.016670,-0.197861,-0.103133,0.017749,0.040816,-0.002644,0.023054,-0.049533,0.032967,0.013094,-0.022900,-0.002450,-0.105387,-0.047878,0.087458,0.102268,0.038642,0.006602,0.003308,0.009395,-0.016442,-0.065755,-0.081549,-0.097971,0.034869,-0.007762,0.023671,0.009740,-0.026813,-0.014335,0.072307,-0.018296,-0.006506,-0.068246,0.004967,-0.012556,-0.014674,0.004461,0.015245,-0.012734,0.027540,-0.038200,-0.020730,-0.043210,-0.008488,0.081341,0.033794,-0.056954,0.044633,-0.038929,0.025655,0.049849,0.051566,-0.010362,-0.031869,-0.053428,-0.031746,-0.044736,-0.056737,-0.060716,0.002957,-0.061618,0.041959,0.045579,-0.042319,0.039064,-0.029458,0.008917,0.059022,0.004974,0.044005,-0.002618,0.029890,-0.000154,-0.032691,-0.051288,-0.024146,-0.041753,0.000000,-0.014153,0.015390,0.021265,0.064299,-0.007231,-0.008051,-0.029062,0.001343,0.028449,0.133267,0.013085,0.029179,0.030582,0.033537,0.033232,-0.024834,-0.123461,0.036584,-0.003936,0.017087,-0.03307