  ('RS12','Reference checks - legal risk & low value. Checks. Reference checking remains near-universal practice but is often done inconsistently (different questions per candidate, unstructured notes) and both sides are cautious about what they say — candidates supply hand-picked referees and employers/referees fear defamation or negligent-referral exposure, so reference calls often yield little beyond confirming dates of employment. Common questions: just a box-ticking call," "they''ll only give you their best mate as a referee anyway," "HR won''t say anything beyond dates and title now," "hard to get anyone to say anything real," "read between the lines.','[-0.071338,0.028155,-0.041493,-0.029910,0.060952,0.033378,0.039937,0.008490,0.045044,-0.053638,-0.056217,0.012843,-0.057337,-0.038650,-0.021713,0.018108,0.047893,-0.016451,0.038773,0.044527,0.034646,-0.011369,-0.054428,-0.058578,-0.025022,-0.113937,-0.026482,0.026682,0.002373,-0.029974,-0.084385,0.168651,-0.074187,-0.014448,0.002512,-0.002419,-0.037435,0.012326,0.019706,0.001534,-0.029758,-0.025521,-0.004628,0.010070,-0.072525,0.031695,0.116082,-0.007375,-0.079950,0.033602,-0.097031,-0.040659,0.098221,0.002777,0.014126,-0.020157,0.027176,-0.009945,-0.037924,0.047859,-0.028946,-0.046867,-0.061561,-0.067021,-0.043098,-0.024466,-0.090375,-0.006555,-0.012495,0.029326,-0.028288,0.001135,0.002891,0.042765,-0.005433,0.062105,-0.026254,-0.020474,0.060617,-0.082308,-0.068005,-0.075609,0.009256,-0.006451,0.026495,0.026554,-0.033616,0.022130,0.040365,0.027627,0.045223,-0.052761,0.104012,-0.048578,0.063093,0.036456,-0.036929,0.074140,0.068628,-0.005276,-0.014919,0.116607,-0.047671,0.040582,0.068594,0.019140,0.007408,0.006956,0.033161,-0.035151,-0.030281,0.040189,0.034553,0.025416,-0.011684,-0.046864,0.008425,-0.007715,-0.072503,-0.034677,-0.008654,0.107048,-0.039280,0.026931,-0.060189,-0.029342,0.034924,0.000000,0.078186,0.079990,-0.023783,-0.002283,-0.081754,-0.041361,-0.093803,0.005933,0.078600,0.042766,-0.006240,0.01900