  ('RS13','Police/criminal checks as an overreaching filter. Checks. Some SMEs require a national police check for every role regardless of relevance, and treat any disclosed record as an automatic disqualifier ("any record = no job"), rather than assessing whether the specific offence is relevant to the specific role''s inherent requirements. Common questions: we run a police check on everyone as standard," "any record and it''s a no from us," "just our policy," "can''t risk it," "better safe than sorry.','[-0.009443,0.044349,-0.027746,-0.040114,0.093831,0.060539,0.063480,-0.109771,-0.026488,-0.038874,0.040351,-0.024119,-0.008421,-0.016150,-0.064709,-0.072036,0.033555,-0.019083,-0.051602,-0.000250,-0.061920,-0.055007,0.082371,-0.035127,-0.179470,-0.046717,-0.018547,-0.012619,-0.046504,-0.036040,0.025441,0.019110,0.045515,0.114469,-0.012361,-0.077837,0.017672,0.021347,-0.002426,-0.072228,0.017211,-0.060458,-0.033930,0.025568,-0.040888,0.042365,0.044220,-0.028831,-0.092030,-0.064157,-0.026346,-0.010803,0.053948,0.040262,-0.023595,-0.056138,-0.019113,0.012902,-0.026553,0.007342,-0.038195,-0.008658,-0.011658,0.003193,0.047215,0.027193,-0.128311,-0.011903,0.032658,0.046280,-0.037079,-0.050319,0.002310,0.078599,-0.061613,0.020001,0.032391,-0.028183,0.055778,-0.010925,-0.032354,-0.033405,-0.060972,0.056866,0.015056,-0.008744,-0.056343,-0.030147,0.023343,-0.020283,0.040955,-0.010184,0.061970,-0.057613,0.036067,-0.013172,0.015029,0.086529,-0.006185,-0.002358,0.007139,0.020145,-0.019895,-0.027862,0.041773,0.040094,0.000156,-0.006387,-0.023225,-0.018823,0.068470,0.040348,0.046835,-0.011780,0.073654,-0.030970,-0.070636,0.113306,-0.091888,-0.029445,-0.033551,0.028933,-0.037203,0.005252,0.006356,0.044078,-0.018491,0.000000,0.040657,0.066108,0.011917,-0.076831,-0.006510,-0.017945,-0.059916,0.055034,0.087698,0.131943,-0.024372,0.063334,-0.012787,-0.027293,0.045667,0.164441,0.017650,0.032454,0.021415,0.022879,0.023166,-0.101875,-0.061618,0.029994,-0.027472,-0.032910,-0.016876,0.060