  ('RS14','Right-to-work / visa verification (VEVO) gaps. Checks. Employers are legally required to verify a prospective employee''s right to work in Australia before employment starts, and to monitor visa conditions (expiry, work-hour limits, sponsorship conditions) for the duration of employment. VEVO (Visa Entitlement Verification Online), run by the Department of Home Affairs, is the mechanism for this — it confirms visa status, work rights, conditions and expiry with the visa holder''s consent. Many SMEs either skip this check, do it only at the start (not on an ongoing basis for time-limited visas), or rely on candidate self-report without verification. Common questions: took their word for it," "didn''t think to check," "assumed the agency handled that," "we''ll sort the visa stuff once they start," "PR, so didn''t need to check" (often stated without verification).','[-0.010205,0.009466,-0.043440,-0.042941,0.054714,0.051468,-0.032598,-0.076153,-0.037151,0.024581,0.060123,0.001251,-0.033658,0.039194,0.009630,-0.056654,0.012954,-0.042941,0.013370,-0.070497,-0.024916,-0.003941,-0.084806,0.022820,0.038246,0.034960,0.017265,0.023799,0.032791,-0.001946,0.005445,0.034105,0.042553,-0.012199,0.068697,-0.026715,0.006441,0.046754,-0.006526,-0.106786,0.055780,-0.125962,-0.010334,-0.010483,-0.049850,0.032292,0.080302,0.020675,-0.069389,0.052626,-0.019859,-0.023288,0.037939,0.045468,-0.065979,-0.026454,0.053581,-0.024519,-0.041387,-0.006420,0.029838,-0.093197,-0.087502,-0.009795,0.041646,0.018839,-0.086593,-0.012990,0.022579,0.038562,-0.027395,-0.086774,-0.049719,0.079817,-0.036685,-0.042051,0.120436,-0.007759,0.066480,-0.077816,-0.009272,0.015930,-0.051046,0.044452,0.021303,-0.051253,0.006461,0.052762,0.102891,-0.027634,0.061536,-0.017292,0.003148,-0.055841,0.059436,-0.045152,-0.013276,0.014679,0.005324,-0.001815,0.041526,-0.045233,-0.013463,0.037214,0.060681,0.067262,0.021304,0.011573,0.044987,-0.004378,0.003698,0.027428,0.076949,0.036923,-0.011377,0.020409,0.015266,0.1