  ('RS15','Qualification/credential verification gaps. Checks. Employers frequently accept a copy of a degree, diploma or trade certificate at face value without independent verification, creating exposure to CV fraud. Documented Australian cases include organised operations selling fake degree/diploma certificates purportedly from dozens of real TAFEs and universities, and fraudulent trade certificate schemes issuing false construction industry qualifications. Common questions: took the certificate at face value," "looked legit to me," "didn''t think to call the uni," "we usually only check for the licensed roles," "sighted the original, that''s usually enough for us.','[-0.056012,0.053966,-0.022671,0.031036,0.023508,-0.005605,-0.008726,-0.082700,-0.028418,-0.006401,0.053767,-0.054667,0.035660,0.029698,-0.011712,-0.077234,-0.009281,0.000132,0.045473,-0.045035,-0.078472,0.017141,-0.054377,-0.053293,0.069194,-0.030869,0.018183,0.028024,0.017593,-0.039776,0.013583,0.052663,-0.022875,-0.028808,0.074702,0.008284,0.033178,0.032983,0.033048,-0.052255,0.054199,-0.095359,0.012552,0.036450,-0.008683,0.031369,0.037724,-0.025707,-0.065843,-0.033977,-0.056872,-0.023225,0.004374,0.007800,-0.091620,-0.016876,0.002879,0.045804,-0.063684,-0.012926,0.036382,0.047719,0.030170,-0.008024,0.017851,0.080360,-0.134113,-0.017031,0.074192,0.023976,0.077405,-0.075213,-0.048065,0.051903,0.044856,-0.065603,0.050450,-0.024453,0.029546,0.017556,-0.002867,0.068867,-0.043557,-0.047446,0.038445,-0.088486,0.059036,0.045436,0.031114,0.000351,0.069428,-0.113206,0.054486,0.017572,0.117355,-0.024130,0.004113,0.055470,0.087951,-0.046932,-0.074276,-0.063653,-0.088756,0.044844,0.011331,0.065882,-0.045915,-0.020202,0.042345,-0.027330,0.043064,0.050819,-0.042919,-0.014018,0.027072,0.111318,-0.016874,0.054262,-0.000125,-0.015962,-0.001460,0.027882,-0.027185,-0.055198,-0.029353,-0.084857,-0.041648,0.000000,-0.003021,0.100533,-0.008625,0.038676,0.035374,-0.022726,-0.036910,0.028769,0.036741,0.151096,-0.008003,0