  ('RS16','Offer letters/contracts missing essential terms. Offer. SME offer letters are frequently informal (a short email confirming a start date and salary) and miss essential terms that protect both parties — employment type, ordinary hours, location, superannuation, probation terms and notice provisions, and reference to the Fair Work Information Statement. This creates ambiguity that surfaces later as a dispute. Common questions: just sent a quick email confirming the details," "we''ll sort the formal contract later," "verbal offer first, paperwork to follow," "kept it simple.','[-0.060564,0.019437,0.112554,0.073705,0.017165,0.056294,0.018218,0.010491,0.038596,-0.004700,0.027921,0.039242,-0.045877,-0.029630,0.040025,-0.043706,-0.040674,-0.040809,-0.001361,-0.001080,-0.027778,0.059434,-0.003037,-0.057487,0.055156,-0.062051,-0.025707,0.051804,-0.020549,0.014915,0.003334,0.104166,0.122031,0.030448,0.049175,0.010641,-0.061008,-0.015172,-0.035906,-0.086479,-0.014962,-0.069252,-0.011217,0.042101,-0.065326,0.010568,0.019101,-0.004862,-0.072736,0.002527,0.020671,-0.075275,-0.013781,0.050245,-0.046076,0.031176,-0.079190,-0.037964,-0.008637,-0.010788,-0.008632,-0.057959,-0.064998,0.010399,0.038325,-0.016850,0.014677,-0.011435,-0.047040,0.016753,-0.065550,-0.065442,-0.094841,0.119837,-0.021239,-0.005653,0.065083,-0.015726,0.002122,-0.000748,-0.131752,-0.000259,-0.046927,0.021103,-0.028047,0.021984,-0.000616,0.017706,0.075727,0.027204,0.015590,-0.131298,-0.028858,-0.069603,0.002730,-0.033098,0.008098,-0.004999,-0.027554,0.036730,0.072479,0.010198,-0.021610,-0.012331,0.012117,-0.014106,-0.018571,-0.103322,-0.021775,0.010678,-0.067862,0.003125,0.004298,-0.056632,-0.037547,0.002165,-0.063330,0.062762,0.101641,-0.080263,-0.046727,0.027142,-0.030297,-0.096733,-0.072542,0.003107,0.012181,-0.000000,0.004481,0.036414,-0.008857,0.030181,0.027201,-0.007818,0.012346,0.040014,-0.063976,0.095296,0.002483,0.067999,0.078665,0.006673,-0.083339,0.035302,0.058579,0.070356,0.031916,0.023374