  ('RS19','Two-way candidate ghosting. Candidate experience. Ghosting now runs in both directions — candidates disappearing after applying or even after accepting an offer, and employers failing to respond to applicants at all (often the majority of a large applicant pool, per A1). Both damage the SME''s ability to hire efficiently and its employer brand in a small, networked local labour market. Common questions: just stopped replying," "went dark," "no-showed the interview," "accepted then never turned up on day one," "we ghost most of them because who has time to reply," "radio silence.','[-0.020776,-0.024648,0.061229,0.064154,0.078108,-0.011554,-0.029684,-0.057662,-0.034799,-0.092319,-0.026682,0.014434,-0.006500,-0.075492,0.005272,-0.003093,0.041881,-0.052101,0.005036,0.013620,-0.073581,-0.013128,-0.067952,-0.049981,0.034897,-0.111933,-0.000727,-0.028799,-0.024145,-0.062725,-0.015324,0.124265,-0.053724,0.028024,0.084005,-0.066124,0.006753,0.036847,-0.052769,-0.057529,0.056200,-0.049643,-0.066728,-0.068216,-0.074409,-0.062353,0.037599,0.047011,0.010900,-0.007466,-0.034367,-0.039517,0.057728,0.023683,-0.009750,0.018811,-0.017905,0.098958,-0.049765,0.093615,-0.013319,-0.029239,-0.088098,0.035742,0.094090,-0.000211,-0.052863,-0.093279,0.033140,0.066475,0.011875,-0.031730,-0.102211,-0.005553,0.065066,-0.000776,0.022895,-0.006793,0.071328,0.034752,-0.007853,-0.141623,-0.065878,-0.024933,0.012089,-0.061929,-0.061395,-0.006749,0.041834,0.088023,-0.013317,0.037631,0.009427,0.016495,0.064779,-0.030932,0.008268,0.163881,-0.017299,0.075294,-0.074120,-0.009941,0.000715,-0.020187,-0.008434,-0.081199,-0.030550,-0.086231,0.071996,-0.021527,0.020378,0.023785,0.020068,0.034500,0.017816,0.042233,0.040036,0.047760,-0.018527,-0.016128,-0.037147,0.041502,0.008189,-0.096093,0.034745,-0.058230,0.009346,0.000000,-0.017996,0.066625,0.012131,0.021797,-0.013570,0.019090,-0.050378,0.028205,0.014861,0.066050,-0.044580,0.049223,0.060195,-0.017508,0.014651,0.006561,0.016820,0.079542,-0.047401,