  ('RS20','Slow time-to-hire losing candidates. Candidate experience. SMEs without dedicated recruitment resourcing typically take longer to move from application to offer than larger, process-driven competitors, and lose strong candidates to faster-moving employers as a direct result — compounding the ghosting problem (H1) and the counter-offer problem (G3). Common questions: by the time we got back to them they''d taken another offer," "process just dragged on," "couldn''t get everyone in the same room to decide," "took three weeks just to get to interview," "lost another good one to someone faster.','[-0.096997,-0.030090,0.063122,0.042442,0.107899,-0.004489,-0.001499,-0.044946,0.019825,-0.039336,0.009528,0.036964,-0.001237,-0.091297,-0.007947,-0.076885,-0.017075,-0.029285,-0.012420,-0.023387,-0.088328,-0.029427,-0.084571,-0.033962,0.087809,-0.115479,-0.005313,-0.005694,0.031238,-0.031667,-0.028367,0.067056,0.020881,0.029229,0.097882,0.028107,-0.103685,-0.039489,-0.033205,-0.023279,0.041113,-0.022319,-0.080630,-0.005786,-0.042320,-0.028024,0.012409,0.049331,-0.006000,-0.021975,-0.046828,-0.071804,-0.005517,-0.038020,-0.032391,0.037078,0.003598,0.034052,-0.027430,0.054682,-0.019966,-0.057484,-0.044931,0.027736,0.101477,-0.007715,-0.019542,-0.044615,-0.006443,0.072223,0.004253,0.000957,-0.156020,0.045195,0.050246,0.009675,0.030181,0.020624,0.038547,0.012027,0.014324,-0.102410,-0.101587,0.020296,-0.043043,-0.066943,-0.039641,-0.005057,0.075434,0.008365,0.009280,-0.003061,-0.004882,-0.008345,0.012489,0.039039,0.031297,0.193471,-0.012949,0.022788,-0.015449,0.057306,0.006080,0.013198,-0.087831,-0.033163,-0.030699,-0.009589,-0.029381,0.014124,-0.031289,-0.021694,0.030758,0.044231,-0.020859,0.038473,-0.003899,0.014287,0.017884,-0.003004,0.016660,0.059394,-0.019115,-0.187339,-0.010152,0.002150,-0.035664,0.000000,-0.055400,0.006524,-0.028799,-0.008753,-0.054948,-0.056684,-0.008716,0.070183,-0.030628,0.054951,-0.070873,0.046089,0.000064,0.002014,-0.042546,-0.037116,0.048434,