  ('RS21','Cost-per-hire pressure & agency-fee dependency. Candidate experience. SMEs without in-house recruitment capability often default to recruitment agencies for anything beyond the simplest roles, paying placement fees typically in the range of 15-25% of the candidate''s first-year salary — a significant cost relative to SME hiring budgets, especially when a placement doesn''t work out and the process must be repeated. Common questions: the agency fee alone was more than we budgeted," "cheaper to do it ourselves but we don''t have the time," "burned twice by a bad agency placement," "20% of salary just to find someone.','[0.014816,-0.048115,-0.030860,0.092755,0.080763,-0.014840,0.009117,-0.010123,0.069649,-0.010158,0.016640,-0.052252,0.039692,0.013212,0.017455,-0.059135,0.060254,-0.055871,0.010673,-0.038696,-0.059575,-0.049937,-0.011397,-0.093259,0.075735,-0.128345,-0.029665,-0.022189,0.004928,0.009288,-0.031783,0.046335,0.001466,0.051281,0.113398,0.019004,-0.075467,0.026378,-0.076260,0.028406,0.035100,0.019685,-0.063029,-0.031827,-0.061171,0.002584,0.032716,0.091738,-0.042606,0.052295,-0.049878,-0.053708,0.026327,-0.020031,-0.028777,-0.014125,0.003305,-0.066024,0.007309,-0.025334,-0.072998,-0.026259,-0.056559,0.019951,0.043605,-0.042335,-0.033723,-0.064633,-0.007759,-0.043450,-0.024373,-0.031494,-0.060692,0.000867,0.088365,0.049329,0.046423,0.091587,0.091879,0.030191,0.019916,-0.069406,-0.067830,0.024904,-0.054716,-0.032417,0.047089,-0.047249,0.043358,0.074663,0.077714,-0.012449,-0.068359,-0.030346,0.028771,0.079716,-0.030885,0.088678,-0.049376,-0.015104,-0.007831,-0.022400,0.022719,0.017932,-0.087455,-0.051145,0.064981,-0.023938,-0.030860,0.024511,0.021544,-0.037164,0.050466,-0.025616,0.091897,0.004403,-0.031717,0.043600,0.088750,0.004513,-0.050343,0.018389,-0.061063,-0.106870,0.001332,0.006162,-0.099625,0.000000,0.079478,0.075927,0.000266,-0.028815,-0.085630,-0.068917,0.038176,0.130238,0.021440,0.068200,-0.012571,-0.014540,-0.008434,-0.017003,0.003518,-0.0