  ('RS22','AI-driven hiring decisions & discrimination liability. AI-in-hiring. Australian anti-discrimination law (Racial Discrimination Act 1975, Sex Discrimination Act 1984, Age Discrimination Act 2004, Disability Discrimination Act 1992) and the Fair Work Act 2009''s general protections apply in full to any hiring decision, regardless of whether a human or an algorithm made or informed it. There is no AI-specific exemption. Employers remain legally liable for discriminatory outcomes produced by a third-party AI tool, even where the discrimination is unintentional, statistically indirect (via a proxy such as postcode or graduation year), and even where the employer did not build or fully understand the tool. Common questions: the software just does the ranking," "the vendor says it''s tested for bias," "didn''t realise we were responsible for how it scores," "we just trust the shortlist," "it''s a black box, honestly.','[-0.080524,-0.010986,-0.010793,0.001866,0.052705,0.084542,-0.011586,-0.048898,-0.026777,0.071088,0.002460,0.028627,0.021254,0.006742,0.023854,0.024097,0.029197,-0.035517,-0.036230,-0.072984,0.030222,0.031506,-0.088142,-0.054662,-0.048726,-0.047094,0.079610,-0.016234,0.005497,0.005900,-0.017006,-0.017683,0.121928,0.026108,-0.014539,-0.063313,-0.072026,-0.046243,0.011546,-0.014018,0.041331,-0.051245,-0.038384,-0.036827,0.054600,0.036343,0.050022,-0.051842,-0.093167,0.003925,-0.064504,0.003865,0.030692,0.034613,-0.053892,-0.081033,-0.004286,0.003226,-0.054607,0.017926,0.012902,-0.064073,0.054167,0.014810,0.034473,0.036492,-0.128850,-0.026727,-0.008454,0.005056,0.003663,0.041043,-0.038541,0.075425,0.116164,0.007171,0.051570,-0.002484,0.093446,-0.112235,-0.046000,-0.051288,-0.024371,0.059630,0.028938,-0.010435,0.025299,0.006632,0.096963,0.007720,0.007362,-0.092300,0.065825,-0.004105,0.078844,-0.055767,0.009805,0.031220,0.000324,0.004868,-0.032751,-0.038543,-0.099811,0.053582,-0.012904,-0.009142,0.037629,-0.071574,0.012427,0.007528,0.038000,-0.009224,0.