  ('RS25','No AI governance / vendor oversight in SME recruitment. AI-in-hiring. Even where SMEs are aware AI is embedded in their recruitment stack, few have any formal governance process — no policy on when AI-assisted decisions require human review, no record-keeping of AI-influenced outcomes, no process for periodically checking whether the tool''s outputs look skewed across candidate groups. This is the practical gap sitting underneath both the discrimination risk (I1) and the privacy risk (I2): the law is clear that the employer is responsible, but most SMEs have no internal mechanism to discharge that responsibility. Common questions: we don''t really have a policy on that," "just use it as it comes," "haven''t looked into how it decides," "no one''s really checking," "assumed the platform sorts that out.','[-0.060014,-0.025856,-0.012172,0.036540,0.123916,0.031925,-0.004636,-0.028565,0.052894,0.015922,-0.042823,0.020835,0.007430,-0.013214,0.038514,0.006021,-0.034422,-0.035612,-0.047401,-0.032781,-0.047160,-0.061536,-0.052553,-0.074667,-0.079944,-0.100518,0.061375,-0.071508,-0.040160,0.007707,-0.032430,-0.023459,0.066830,0.012937,-0.004595,0.005803,-0.049892,-0.015576,0.035980,-0.045287,0.015987,-0.043853,-0.100287,-0.049940,0.038463,0.038562,0.034561,-0.038185,-0.131089,-0.011202,-0.075810,-0.123073,0.092071,0.005941,-0.058930,-0.042610,0.019168,-0.091023,0.048343,0.025812,0.003373,-0.046333,-0.021743,-0.009402,0.077007,0.023723,-0.065857,-0.009415,-0.023632,-0.038732,0.070364,-0.004955,-0.078965,0.082237,0.083039,0.068569,-0.029781,0.037503,0.130956,-0.071881,0.001617,0.028807,0.022957,0.077608,-0.065434,0.023581,-0.010853,-0.005319,0.047531,0.083316,0.028604,-0.055169,-0.035911,-0.000101,0.043423,-0.001917,-0.004038,0.107259,-0.045725,-0.008397,-0.017085,0.045852,-0.038091,0.005682,-0.101591,0.045035,0.050755,-0.071533,0.028685,0.017188,-0.001020,0.005309,0.011149,-0.030249,0.052132,-0.021219,-0.002403,0.141155,0.038683,-0.010103,-0.064089,0.014911,0.034527