  ('RS26','Weak handoff from recruitment to onboarding. Onboarding handoff. In SMEs, the same person (owner/accidental HR rep) often runs recruitment and then onboarding, but without a formal handoff process — meaning compliance paperwork (TFN declaration, super choice form, Fair Work Information Statement), induction planning, and the transfer of candidate/interview information into the new starter''s employee record are done ad hoc, late, or missed entirely. Early attrition is strongly linked to poor onboarding. Common questions: we''ll sort the paperwork on day one," "kind of figure it out as we go," "didn''t realise super forms weren''t done until pay day," "the induction is basically just a chat and a tour," "wasn''t really a formal handover, it''s just me doing both.','[-0.041883,-0.035425,0.031871,0.082069,0.083835,0.032175,0.043142,0.050794,0.003449,-0.018766,-0.002691,0.098499,-0.033743,-0.029764,-0.038237,-0.021492,0.035510,-0.090178,0.055105,0.075591,-0.085392,-0.043010,-0.078012,-0.035506,0.024905,-0.083646,-0.055998,0.017104,0.034140,-0.028672,-0.014193,0.092005,0.065724,0.022897,-0.014958,0.112221,0.052571,-0.006846,-0.060469,-0.012225,0.039654,-0.090894,-0.066090,0.015750,-0.011728,0.020254,0.098433,-0.002009,-0.043317,0.015126,-0.010487,-0.049017,0.089448,-0.044257,-0.018134,0.060782,0.036040,-0.059974,-0.061594,0.035458,-0.028133,0.014214,-0.092195,-0.019589,0.079878,-0.013896,0.011277,-0.081977,0.027979,-0.009043,0.009576,0.005557,-0.113038,0.057340,0.013882,0.045305,-0.035538,0.060536,0.097448,-0.091053,-0.008725,0.002609,-0.093440,0.028992,-0.075673,-0.011222,0.023573,-0.000867,0.045485,0.033213,0.012771,-0.031269,0.033747,-0.011959,-0.062375,0.040229,0.045085,0.106357,-0.015150,-0.006868,0.034122,0.080042,0.034124,0.046209,-0.045641,-0.041417,0.000433,-0.122850,-0.009578,-0.011451,0.036433,0.032231,-0.030363,0.023029,-0.022589,0.076943,-0.125945,0.013844,0.020214,0.010542,-0.056016,0.049997,-0.021460,-0.058863,-0.061076,-0.012125,-0.017949,0.000