  ('X1','HR tech gaps & "spreadsheet-and-hope" workflows. Tooling. Most Australian SMEs run people operations on a patchwork of spreadsheets, email threads, paper files, and whatever free tier their accounting software bundles in, rather than a purpose-built HR system. Employee files sit in scattered folders, leave requests live in inboxes, timesheets are separate spreadsheets, and none of it talks to payroll. The system only "works" because nothing has gone wrong yet — hence "spreadsheet-and-hope."','[-0.113648,0.041236,-0.031474,0.004515,0.019412,-0.000709,-0.029432,0.012695,0.066939,0.018305,0.000474,0.048799,-0.031654,-0.010664,0.052238,0.002172,-0.065837,-0.080933,0.043554,0.007456,-0.066551,0.031599,-0.079344,-0.052651,0.037501,0.008088,-0.063347,0.007872,-0.066774,0.002933,-0.038849,-0.016762,0.039884,0.043997,0.038436,-0.017229,0.009024,0.039206,-0.064679,-0.035091,-0.003039,-0.044604,-0.036545,0.022698,-0.045539,-0.068357,0.029137,-0.035755,-0.088762,0.062453,-0.099394,-0.047169,0.032226,0.097988,0.006486,-0.019274,0.072569,0.057823,-0.034712,-0.048833,-0.075927,-0.041422,-0.065574,-0.004010,0.084206,-0.007663,-0.109968,0.069846,-0.044303,-0.068044,-0.124025,-0.031560,-0.104122,0.119609,0.037188,-0.067342,-0.002373,-0.024180,0.060347,-0.039553,-0.013985,0.053137,0.020169,0.095488,-0.016533,-0.031088,0.032516,0.067613,0.059748,-0.075576,0.023261,0.016663,0.065632,-0.011232,-0.001297,-0.042478,0.011004,0.124219,-0.023158,0.028567,0.022495,0.016121,0.075205,-0.029260,-0.042445,0.012855,0.018101,0.023732,0.003317,-0.073043,0.006381,-0.030680,-0.069450,-0.068165,-0.023572,-0.060990,-0.102815,0.027789,-0.038739,0.051639,0.056882,0.039002,0.009882,-0.087624,0.026543,0.006380,-0.027334,0.000000,0.013277,0.009069,0.031682,0.092685,0.060578,-0.032236,-0.027736,0.018555,0.062563,0.081049,-0.031614,0.151446,-0.010550,0.026067,-0.023321,-0.059331,0.019206,0.108867,0.017634,0.074782,0.038428,-0.031030,0.013487,-0.010534,0.056342,0.071306,0.057851,0.003363,0.075979,0.0092