  ('X2','Record-keeping & documentary-evidence gaps. Tooling/compliance. Under s.535 of the Fair Work Act, employers must make and keep employee records for seven years covering pay, hours, leave, superannuation and more; specific documentation (the Small Business Fair Dismissal Code checklist, redundancy consultation records, performance-management file notes) is what actually determines whether an employer wins or loses a dispute. SMEs typically don''t know the full list of what they''re legally required to keep, and even when they do, they don''t keep it consistently.','[-0.116659,0.041013,0.016103,0.000791,0.086123,0.071326,-0.047038,-0.040226,-0.044048,0.023295,-0.021443,0.086724,-0.030260,-0.063956,-0.066011,0.017734,-0.086924,0.013788,-0.036014,-0.061967,0.036769,-0.019971,-0.027292,0.043060,-0.006239,-0.005553,0.011558,-0.002825,-0.016381,-0.049689,0.029820,-0.009442,0.018390,0.063022,0.052907,-0.025715,-0.001421,0.015922,0.002398,-0.062940,0.012915,-0.037253,-0.025039,-0.041635,-0.032539,0.079369,0.060370,-0.037013,-0.096225,0.060726,-0.096616,-0.043750,0.083140,0.061850,-0.022206,-0.057693,0.042299,-0.035115,-0.100537,0.024882,0.030416,-0.061021,-0.066212,-0.035772,0.024166,0.020994,-0.033118,0.026183,-0.016302,0.044277,-0.085949,0.003450,-0.073664,0.111134,0.024261,-0.004793,-0.019276,-0.012277,0.011251,-0.082801,-0.057014,-0.001705,-0.002325,0.054288,-0.054645,-0.113238,0.075151,0.024691,0.050007,-0.009181,0.047563,-0.032360,0.043799,-0.083246,0.011344,-0.026449,0.019356,0.101775,0.087925,-0.005041,0.027533,0.015374,-0.015118,0.008968,0.036281,-0.015649,0.012211,-0.039770,0.006281,-0.023564,0.064589,0.061052,-0.025309,0.000550,0.102588,-0.010594,-0.097767,0.108689,-0.031694,-0.009071,0.025099,0.089460,-0.000006,-0.030487,-0.058896,0.002324,0.002519,-0.000000,0.045474,-0.025711,-0.060361,0.002797,0.043928,-0.040666,-0.011345,0.035604,0.021886,0.137018,-0.036194,0.089915,-0.005406,-0.082958,0.029125,0.056644,0.004432,0.064789,0.008428,-0.026627,0.058310,-0