  ('X4','Escalation boundary - Recruitment track. Escalation. On the hiring side, the escalation boundary is driven by a smaller number of high-complexity, high-consequence events rather than everyday volume: sponsoring a worker on a skilled visa, and — much more rarely for true SMEs — negotiating an enterprise agreement. Standard job ads, interviews and offers are DIY-safe; anything touching immigration law, industrial instrument-making, or a hiring decision that could be read as discriminatory is not.','[-0.009856,-0.009153,0.015246,-0.023021,0.089008,-0.039022,-0.028896,-0.036015,-0.002061,-0.087539,-0.018036,-0.010526,-0.004685,-0.016912,0.080845,-0.068389,0.022773,-0.008855,-0.044980,-0.049574,-0.053683,-0.066767,-0.054527,-0.028088,-0.013852,-0.092389,0.050714,0.007489,0.014450,-0.031166,0.003683,0.053438,-0.014749,0.122282,0.014688,0.029934,-0.029025,-0.055706,-0.035355,-0.019633,0.013579,-0.045055,-0.032972,-0.005471,0.003384,-0.025562,-0.001519,0.030834,-0.144804,-0.025983,0.023919,-0.092225,0.045463,0.050151,-0.043596,-0.026651,0.062233,-0.025820,0.022753,-0.022100,0.048724,-0.072327,-0.030587,0.026324,-0.015830,-0.090692,-0.017183,0.056251,0.018746,0.064407,0.062133,-0.082157,-0.096379,0.072991,0.082773,-0.000764,-0.005554,0.061781,0.018515,0.030260,0.014598,-0.091332,-0.117816,-0.044826,0.011225,-0.111480,-0.046397,-0.048621,0.070975,0.100162,0.018914,-0.027559,0.016123,-0.002217,0.013211,-0.044350,-0.033049,0.040470,0.012406,0.008366,-0.016803,0.041426,0.027129,0.050004,-0.079354,-0.066610,-0.040182,0.005405,-0.066630,-0.021812,-0.039345,-0.069870,0.096315,-0.050722,0.019465,0.037804,-0.030181,0.048392,-0.018831,0.034307,0.054936,0.012375,-0.100245,-0.086467,-0.018579,-0.020444,0.003338,0.000000,0.052043,0.006838,-0.064881,0.019020,0.065577,0.032678,0.005525,0.022677,0.028836,0.080861,-0.064505,0.104072,0.095685,0.092012,0.047845,-0.018881,-0.047298,0.143214,-0.043957,0.027088,0.024974,-0.067453,-0.066295,0.013708,0.003768,-0.034138,-0.026130,-0.022079,