  ('X5','Cost barrier - prohibitive/opaque legal fees. Economics. SMEs face genuinely high, and often opaque, professional fees for the exact moments they most need advice. Employment lawyers charge $220–$850+/hour depending on seniority (junior $150–$300+, mid-level $300–$500+, senior/specialist $500–$900+); HR consultants charge $150–$500/hour ad hoc or $1,500–$4,500/month on retainer. For a business with a handful of staff, a single complex termination or investigation can cost more in professional fees than the disputed entitlement itself.','[-0.015063,0.071207,-0.029561,-0.004028,0.053741,-0.003085,-0.023649,0.029036,0.070523,0.026152,-0.036231,-0.007768,-0.003216,-0.024149,0.010901,0.079800,0.055216,-0.011972,-0.015472,-0.037856,-0.040175,-0.033422,-0.080328,-0.097809,0.053067,-0.105534,0.047903,-0.038163,-0.008637,0.007853,-0.015997,-0.021091,0.003050,-0.005193,0.070167,0.019247,-0.044310,0.054122,-0.041944,0.041193,0.013987,0.081433,-0.097178,-0.036557,-0.022702,0.005830,0.029260,0.073839,0.018432,0.023588,-0.078951,-0.058658,0.020599,-0.033372,-0.047454,-0.098632,0.050853,-0.032805,-0.014000,0.057320,-0.090072,-0.025673,-0.004784,-0.047048,0.023269,-0.066689,-0.024511,0.017784,-0.010173,0.010460,-0.040912,-0.047356,-0.026283,-0.063021,0.104140,-0.031518,0.021373,0.059448,-0.012175,-0.085891,0.073352,-0.066170,-0.094486,0.019572,-0.020551,-0.069571,0.062600,0.032495,0.075762,0.065687,0.034979,-0.042217,-0.007116,-0.082917,0.041818,-0.018612,-0.023541,0.090918,-0.008140,-0.046235,-0.014004,-0.006836,0.011524,0.007135,-0.008149,0.025980,0.049354,0.025951,0.003581,0.075610,0.010512,-0.011815,-0.046018,-0.006756,0.038636,0.008011,0.010660,0.079669,0.083088,0.013464,0.065751,0.130237,-0.032691,-0.048374,-0.027280,-0.033776,-0.099921,-0.000000,0.016435,0.062917,-0.087777,-0.046924,-0.021114,-0.072153,0.032835,0.040097,0.025874,0.113621,-0.072952,-0.039432,-0.012446,-0.028941,-0.042399,-0.069602,0.063347,0.035247,-0.058318,0.002825,-0.082232,-0.018005,0.020346,0.06