  ('X6','Time poverty - admin crowding out the business. Economics. HR/compliance admin competes directly with the core job the SME owner or accidental HR rep was actually hired to do. Survey evidence consistently shows red tape, payroll compliance and HR/people issues ranking among the top time- and stress-drivers for small business leaders, ahead of many operational concerns.','[-0.065862,-0.023669,0.012961,0.056107,0.063724,0.020722,0.008764,-0.001893,0.000329,0.005194,0.015630,0.048746,0.011268,0.009964,0.019794,-0.029793,0.043117,0.008743,-0.031753,-0.136673,-0.071026,-0.056728,-0.077883,-0.074190,-0.059388,-0.071098,-0.032491,0.053476,-0.022849,-0.037047,-0.025006,-0.088415,0.094996,0.053476,-0.042687,0.065309,0.071611,-0.009683,0.018048,-0.053231,0.042434,-0.071077,-0.068519,-0.114552,-0.001637,-0.048232,0.102248,-0.049038,-0.138014,-0.055187,-0.027819,-0.015348,0.037380,0.004541,-0.002093,0.074542,0.100077,0.036758,0.023593,-0.025280,-0.046783,-0.052142,-0.067372,0.021240,0.095392,0.000037,-0.013396,0.018787,-0.069586,-0.024979,0.059189,-0.103422,-0.097160,0.017079,0.056130,-0.039669,-0.041212,0.041917,0.054728,-0.031460,0.093737,-0.007059,-0.092616,0.109278,-0.082477,-0.034532,0.003027,0.009042,0.106002,-0.018955,0.067825,0.036407,0.050888,-0.013457,-0.010838,-0.027915,-0.035471,0.122658,-0.067678,0.008551,-0.026681,0.063142,-0.042973,0.011150,0.036619,-0.035685,0.059004,0.021304,0.006281,0.049429,0.012278,0.050089,-0.030531,-0.005586,0.013123,-0.077738,-0.079376,-0.000599,0.002601,0.038242,0.046083,0.098023,-0.003894,-0.074275,0.077326,0.016007,-0.061396,0.000000,0.071149,0.056537,0.024082,-0.049706,0.022490,0.038955,-0.080048,-0.016685,0.058271,0.069605,-0.021267,0.080917,0.003942,-0.016038,-0.011371,-0.003971,0.005721,0.072947,-0.047665,0.105034,0.015522,0.003344,-0.009426,0.032192,0.026617,-0.036335,0.008233,-0.003864,0.144636,0.031360,0.000797,-0.037922,0.016365,-0.069058,0.006704,-0.003282,-0.034984,0.025919,0.008666,-0.069497,-0.121765,0.000938,0.070