  ('X7','Confidence barrier - "accidental HR" psychology. Psychology. People handling HR without an HR background or title — office managers, bookkeepers, operations leads, the owner themselves — report a persistent underlying anxiety that they will make a costly mistake without realising it, precisely because they don''t know what they don''t know. This is distinct from time poverty: it''s a confidence/competence gap, not just a bandwidth one.','[-0.011361,0.077646,-0.028439,0.105713,0.085761,-0.020207,0.026727,0.005066,0.024898,-0.007318,0.029065,-0.011974,0.003453,-0.139786,0.015239,-0.054864,0.003628,0.016624,-0.054306,0.010469,-0.070072,0.012779,-0.043006,-0.056839,-0.044047,-0.039068,-0.019871,0.034504,-0.011097,-0.023604,0.029595,-0.017515,0.003276,-0.014630,-0.004803,0.027871,-0.012230,0.070772,0.054552,-0.044604,-0.027643,-0.043395,-0.018912,0.035685,-0.032689,-0.031964,0.071968,-0.003099,-0.083414,-0.063304,-0.111989,-0.033890,0.053261,0.003206,0.004066,0.013621,0.012094,0.078196,-0.101676,0.063597,-0.053564,-0.086311,-0.042621,-0.030280,0.040840,0.063590,-0.049442,0.043199,0.074069,-0.014247,0.036892,-0.080678,-0.063707,-0.000624,0.099927,-0.040152,-0.056509,0.000953,0.041041,0.049241,0.047514,-0.013178,-0.068481,0.118273,-0.062374,-0.058916,0.032596,0.016542,-0.028290,-0.042755,-0.023424,-0.090059,-0.009587,0.013806,-0.017126,-0.024422,-0.070554,0.070642,-0.050993,0.004777,0.017899,0.037796,-0.036772,0.067191,-0.060182,0.000056,0.028416,-0.010065,0.008258,-0.003173,-0.076137,0.016405,-0.049347,-0.005874,0.050849,-0.008892,-0.086666,0.016687,0.058559,0.046893,0.097665,0.082400,0.046464,-0.036755,-0.005332,-0.085345,-0.021653,-0.000000,0.064411,0.007843,-0.023435,-0.034986,0.023239,0.035094,-0.078143,-0.035747,0.089215,0.089874,0.004975,-0.030647,0.024939,-0.026427,-0.010202,0.037456,-0.041237,0.120695,-0.002255,0.079674,0.014798,0.048891,0.015152,0.025138,-0.021554,0.014717,-0.011867,-0.027242,0.111427,0.051970,-0.046989,0.025179,0.016274,-0.041594,0.0102