  ('X8','Where SMEs currently go for answers. Behaviour. In the absence of an affordable, reliable single channel, SMEs triangulate HR answers from a patchwork of free or informal sources of wildly varying quality: Google search, the Fair Work Ombudsman website and helpline, their bookkeeper or accountant, other business owners/"mates," franchisor guidance (for franchised operators), and industry association resources — with paid lawyer/consultant advice reserved for when a matter feels serious enough (see 6.5).','[-0.026979,-0.041926,-0.000643,0.029702,0.037537,0.004158,-0.002154,0.020421,0.015652,-0.002718,-0.021144,0.023859,-0.026769,-0.006407,0.056876,-0.028017,0.023923,-0.008197,0.000751,-0.076916,-0.082917,-0.044187,-0.024290,-0.059181,-0.000983,-0.109290,-0.015637,-0.038722,-0.054214,-0.071037,-0.019928,0.023987,0.021739,0.026772,-0.004004,0.031818,0.024819,0.006722,-0.045729,-0.034241,0.023078,-0.035522,-0.051393,-0.024335,-0.032865,-0.026297,0.038034,-0.032575,-0.037580,-0.031753,-0.095498,-0.080054,0.034757,-0.022492,0.007044,-0.014837,-0.013426,0.002711,0.024328,-0.050629,0.013856,-0.042444,-0.081014,0.002213,0.100858,-0.013605,-0.015116,0.114897,-0.121554,-0.046635,-0.005842,-0.125479,-0.021812,0.130790,0.060180,0.030437,0.034530,-0.010155,0.058860,-0.014487,-0.047647,-0.013514,-0.058757,0.097895,-0.038412,0.017012,-0.001568,0.048040,0.070816,0.037037,-0.022895,0.053861,-0.010168,-0.092864,0.012084,-0.001700,-0.011644,0.036996,-0.041393,0.034881,0.029599,0.044683,0.019524,-0.025925,-0.004071,0.041506,-0.012933,0.104040,0.050513,0.005951,-0.063977,0.031930,-0.043349,-0.056024,0.056882,-0.052779,-0.045704,0.064680,0.072122,-0.110820,-0.012658,0.100050,0.032474,-0.039609,0.038120,0.024659,-0.069057,0.000000,0.020273,0.046256,0.074676,0.000253,-0.014007,0.014968,-0.027029,0.057979,0.076302,0.091581,0.033210,0.105679,-0.026538,-0.072427,-0.012025,-0.051176,-0.022017,0.066205,-0.058870,-0.041675,0.021022,0.009455,0.038071,0.067443,0.057046,-0.111636,0.022847,-