  ('X9','Economics of outsourced HR/legal advice (what''s displaced). Economics. SMEs today pay for HR/employment-law reassurance through three broad channels: (1) hourly employment-lawyer engagement for specific matters, (2) HR consultant ad hoc hours or monthly retainers, and (3) fixed-fee outsourced HR/WHS subscription providers (the Employsure model) that bundle "unlimited advice" for a recurring fee. Each has a different cost/certainty trade-off, and none is well matched to a business that has no *constant* HR need but wants ongoing reassurance.','[-0.066088,-0.022660,-0.036415,0.048913,0.081769,0.031552,0.016113,0.012029,0.062292,0.011787,-0.034760,0.050059,0.038003,-0.005345,0.030756,0.016752,0.001792,-0.048255,-0.050945,-0.046467,-0.054445,-0.018540,-0.078833,-0.065274,0.043521,-0.109705,0.035248,0.030546,-0.028098,-0.045138,-0.009102,0.025933,-0.022479,-0.006696,0.007478,0.008580,-0.040994,0.003658,-0.061650,0.061883,0.030859,-0.005056,-0.063731,0.037913,-0.024809,-0.014639,0.060978,0.048409,-0.077560,0.064746,-0.040640,-0.086250,0.005124,0.084761,-0.026359,-0.027405,-0.014844,-0.006025,-0.016048,0.022329,0.005977,-0.023215,-0.078584,0.020174,0.008127,-0.027739,-0.045694,0.068925,-0.098460,-0.007887,-0.017235,-0.104543,-0.061839,-0.026584,0.086845,-0.037256,0.058894,-0.009653,0.075640,-0.067260,0.009298,-0.000262,-0.040215,0.015761,-0.035946,-0.055975,-0.028054,-0.023679,0.137210,-0.001144,0.019694,-0.009911,-0.015812,-0.090066,0.035651,0.033138,-0.043471,0.110957,-0.044102,0.006569,-0.034695,0.000083,0.017237,-0.016815,-0.020886,-0.092338,0.012634,0.102501,0.072720,0.054547,-0.014049,0.041019,0.046169,0.008850,0.066843,0.044221,-0.002439,0.073448,0.058017,0.010261,0.014958,0.103129,0.029766,-0.087215,-0.004891,-0.015369,-0.086233,0.000000,-0.015537,0.073470,0.010763,-0.045452,0.012398,-0.043064,0.003073,0.015862,0.042811,0.077683,-0.063613,0.109687,-0.003896,-0.002059,-0.078271,-0.046423,0.016959,0.176629,-0.000548,0.070522,0.033656,0.044308,0.021772,0.021